          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-1">
      <lrml:Comment>对监护人的确定有争议的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门指定监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-1", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c31-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>对监护人的确定有争议的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateGuardian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-1-court">
      <lrml:Comment>有关当事人对指定不服的，或者直接，可以向人民法院申请指定监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-1-court", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-1-court">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concernedParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c31-1-court-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>有关当事人对指定不服的，或者直接，可以向人民法院申请指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyCourtDesignation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-2">
      <lrml:Comment>指定机关应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿，按照最有利于被监护人的原则在依法具有监护资格的人中指定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-2", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designator"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c31-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>指定机关应当尊重被监护人的真实意愿，按照最有利于被监护人的原则在依法具有监护资格的人中指定</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateAmongEligibleInBestInterest"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-3">
      <lrml:Comment>指定监护人前，被监护人的合法权益处于无人保护状态的，由被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门等担任临时监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-3", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDispute"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unprotectedBeforeDesignation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:temporaryGuardian"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-designated">
      <lrml:Comment>被指定的人为监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-designated", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-designated">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c31-4">
      <lrml:Comment>监护人被指定后，不得擅自变更
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-4", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-4">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c31-4-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>监护人被指定后，不得擅自变更</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:changeGuardianUnilaterally"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c31-4-liab">
      <lrml:Comment>擅自变更的，不免除被指定的监护人的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c31-4-liab", "articles": ["31"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c31-4-liab">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:changedWithoutAuthorization"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releasedFromGuardianResponsibility"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c32">
      <lrml:Comment>没有依法具有监护资格的人的，监护人由民政部门担任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c32", "articles": ["32"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c32">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasEligibleGuardian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
            <ruleml:Ind>civilAffairs</ruleml:Ind>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c32-committee">
      <lrml:Comment>也可以由具备履行监护职责条件的被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会担任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c32-committee", "articles": ["32"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c32-committee">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:needsGuardian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasEligibleGuardian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:committeeAbleToServe"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c32-committee-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>也可以由具备履行监护职责条件的被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会担任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:serveAsGuardian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c33">
      <lrml:Comment>完全民事行为能力的成年人可以书面事先确定监护人，在其丧失或者部分丧失民事行为能力时，由该监护人履行监护职责
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c33", "articles": ["33"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c33">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:writtenVoluntaryGuardianAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:madeWhileFullyCapable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialGuardianSet"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c34-1">
      <lrml:Comment>监护人的职责是代理被监护人实施民事法律行为，保护其人身权利、财产权利以及其他合法权益
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c34-1", "articles": ["34"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c34-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>监护人的职责是代理被监护人实施民事法律行为，保护其人身权利、财产权利以及其他合法权益</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:representAndProtectWard"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c34-3">
      <lrml:Comment>监护人不履行监护职责或者侵害被监护人合法权益的，应当承担法律责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c34-3", "articles": ["34"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsGuardianDuty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesWardRights"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearsLegalLiability"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c34-4">
      <lrml:Comment>因突发事件等紧急情况被监护人无人照料的，被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门应当安排必要的临时生活照料措施
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c34-4", "articles": ["34"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c34-4">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianTemporarilyUnableByEmergency"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wardUnattended"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:localAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c34-4-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>因突发事件等紧急情况被监护人无人照料的，被监护人住所地的居民委员会、村民委员会或者民政部门应当安排必要的临时生活照料措施</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arrangeTemporaryCare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-best">
      <lrml:Comment>监护人应当按照最有利于被监护人的原则履行监护职责
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c35-best", "articles": ["35"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-best">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c35-best-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>监护人应当按照最有利于被监护人的原则履行监护职责</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actInWardsBestInterest"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-dispose">
      <lrml:Comment>监护人除为维护被监护人利益外，不得处分被监护人的财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c35-dispose", "articles": ["35"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-dispose">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forWardsInterest"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c35-dispose-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>监护人除为维护被监护人利益外，不得处分被监护人的财产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disposeWardProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-minor">
      <lrml:Comment>未成年人的监护人作出与被监护人利益有关的决定时，应当根据其年龄和智力状况尊重其真实意愿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c35-minor", "articles": ["35"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-minor">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:decisionAffectingWard"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c35-minor-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>未成年人的监护人作出与被监护人利益有关的决定时，应当根据其年龄和智力状况尊重其真实意愿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:respectWishesByAgeAndIntellect"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-adult">
      <lrml:Comment>成年人的监护人应当最大程度地尊重被监护人的真实意愿，保障并协助其实施相适应的民事法律行为
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c35-adult", "articles": ["35"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-adult">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c35-adult-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>成年人的监护人应当最大程度地尊重被监护人的真实意愿，保障并协助其实施相适应的民事法律行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:respectWishesToMaximum"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c35-noninterf">
      <lrml:Comment>对被监护人有能力独立处理的事务，监护人不得干涉
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c35-noninterf", "articles": ["35"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c35-noninterf">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wardCanHandleAlone"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c35-noninterf-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>对被监护人有能力独立处理的事务，监护人不得干涉</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interfereInAffair"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-ground">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销事由：严重损害被监护人身心健康；怠于或无法履行且拒绝委托致其危困；其他严重侵害其合法权益的行为
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-ground", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-ground">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriouslyHarmsWard"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:neglectOrRefusalLeavesWardInDistress"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherSeriousInfringement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-1">
      <lrml:Comment>有撤销事由的，人民法院根据有关个人或者组织的申请，撤销其监护人资格
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-1", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationApplied"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c36-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>有撤销事由的，人民法院根据有关个人或者组织的申请，撤销其监护人资格</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeGuardianship"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-after">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销后安排必要的临时监护措施，并按照最有利于被监护人的原则依法指定监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-after", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-after">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c36-after-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>撤销后安排必要的临时监护措施，并按照最有利于被监护人的原则依法指定监护人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arrangeTemporaryMeasuresAndDesignate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-2">
      <lrml:Comment>可以申请撤销的有关个人、组织
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-2", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concernsWard"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleGuardian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantOrg"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorsProtectionOrg"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:qualifiedRevocationApplicant"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c36-3">
      <lrml:Comment>其他个人和组织未及时申请的，民政部门应当向人民法院申请
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-3", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:othersFailedToApplyInTime"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c36-3-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>其他个人和组织未及时申请的，民政部门应当向人民法院申请</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>civilAffairs</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyForRevocation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c36-effect">
      <lrml:Comment>被撤销监护人资格的，不再是监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c36-effect", "articles": ["36"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c36-effect">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c37">
      <lrml:Comment>依法负担抚养费、赡养费、扶养费的父母、子女、配偶等，被撤销监护人资格后，应当继续履行负担的义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c37", "articles": ["37"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c37">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesMaintenance"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c37-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>依法负担抚养费、赡养费、扶养费的父母、子女、配偶等，被撤销监护人资格后，应当继续履行负担的义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:continuePayingMaintenance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c38">
      <lrml:Comment>被撤销资格的父母或者子女，确有悔改表现的，经其申请，人民法院可以视情况恢复其监护人资格（对被监护人实施故意犯罪的除外）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c38", "articles": ["38"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianRepented"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedForRestoration"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentionalCrimeAgainstWard"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c38-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>被撤销资格的父母或者子女，确有悔改表现的，经其申请，人民法院可以视情况恢复其监护人资格（对被监护人实施故意犯罪的除外）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restoreGuardianship"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c38-restored">
      <lrml:Comment>恢复监护人资格的，重新成为监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c38-restored", "articles": ["38"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38-restored">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRestored"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c38-end">
      <lrml:Comment>恢复后，人民法院指定的监护人与被监护人的监护关系同时终止
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c38-end", "articles": ["38"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c38-end">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipRestored"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedGuardian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-1">
      <lrml:Comment>被监护人取得或恢复完全民事行为能力、监护人丧失监护能力、一方死亡或者法院认定的其他情形，监护关系终止
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c39-1", "articles": ["39"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servedAsGuardian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lostGuardianCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:died"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:died"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtFindsTermination"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-end">
      <lrml:Comment>监护关系终止的，不再是监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c39-end", "articles": ["39"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-end">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c39-2">
      <lrml:Comment>监护关系终止后，被监护人仍然需要监护的，应当依法另行确定监护人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c39-2", "articles": ["39"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c39-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianshipTerminated"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
