    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c40">
      <lrml:Comment>自然人下落不明满二年的，利害关系人可以申请宣告其为失踪人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c40", "articles": ["40"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
