      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-1">
      <lrml:Comment>财产代管人应当妥善管理失踪人的财产，维护其财产权益
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c43-1", "articles": ["43"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
