    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-2">
      <lrml:Comment>失踪人所欠税款、债务和应付的其他费用，由财产代管人从失踪人的财产中支付
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c43-2", "articles": ["43"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c43-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owedByMissingPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c43-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>失踪人所欠税款、债务和应付的其他费用，由财产代管人从失踪人的财产中支付</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payFromMissingPersonsProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c43-3">
      <lrml:Comment>财产代管人因故意或者重大过失造成失踪人财产损失的，应当承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c43-3", "articles": ["43"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c43-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianIntent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianGrossNegligence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingPersonsPropertyLost"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c43-3-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人因故意或者重大过失造成失踪人财产损失的，应当承担赔偿责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:compensateMissingPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-1">
      <lrml:Comment>财产代管人不履行职责、侵害失踪人财产权益或者丧失代管能力的，利害关系人可以申请变更
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c44-1", "articles": ["44"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsCustodyDuty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesMissingPersonsProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksCustodyCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c44-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人不履行职责、侵害失踪人财产权益或者丧失代管能力的，利害关系人可以申请变更</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyChangeCustodian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-2">
      <lrml:Comment>财产代管人有正当理由的，可以申请变更财产代管人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c44-2", "articles": ["44"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:justifiedReason"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c44-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>财产代管人有正当理由的，可以申请变更财产代管人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyChangeCustodian"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c44-3">
      <lrml:Comment>变更后的财产代管人有权请求原财产代管人及时移交有关财产并报告代管情况
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c44-3", "articles": ["44"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c44-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:custodianChanged"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c44-3-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandHandoverAndReport"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K1</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K0</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c45-1">
      <lrml:Comment>失踪人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销失踪宣告
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c45-1", "articles": ["45"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c45-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedToRevokeMissing"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c45-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>失踪人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销失踪宣告</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeMissingDeclaration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c45-2">
      <lrml:Comment>失踪人重新出现，有权请求财产代管人及时移交有关财产并报告代管情况
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c45-2", "articles": ["45"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c45-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredMissing"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyCustodian"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c45-2-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandHandoverAndReport"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c46-cond">
      <lrml:Comment>宣告死亡的条件：下落不明满四年；因意外事件下落不明满二年；或因意外事件下落不明且经有关机关证明不可能生存（不受二年限制）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c46-cond", "articles": ["46"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c46-cond">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingFor4Years"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissingFor2Years"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:And>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:certifiedCannotSurvive"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:And>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c46-apply">
      <lrml:Comment>符合条件的，利害关系人可以申请宣告该自然人死亡
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c46-apply", "articles": ["46"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c46-apply">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c46-apply-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>符合条件的，利害关系人可以申请宣告该自然人死亡</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyDeathDeclaration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c47">
      <lrml:Comment>有的申请宣告死亡、有的申请宣告失踪，符合宣告死亡条件的，人民法院应当宣告死亡
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c47", "articles": ["47"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c47">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationApplied"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:missingDeclarationApplied"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationConditionsMet"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c47-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>有的申请宣告死亡、有的申请宣告失踪，符合宣告死亡条件的，人民法院应当宣告死亡</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declareDeath"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c48-1">
      <lrml:Comment>宣告死亡的判决作出之日视为其死亡的日期
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c48-1", "articles": ["48"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c48-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:judgmentDate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedDeathDate"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c48-2">
      <lrml:Comment>因意外事件下落不明宣告死亡的，意外事件发生之日视为其死亡的日期
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c48-2", "articles": ["48"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c48-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentMissing"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accidentDate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedDeathDate"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c49">
      <lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡但并未死亡的，不影响其在被宣告死亡期间实施的民事法律行为的效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c49", "articles": ["49"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c49">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actuallyAlive"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actDuringDeclaredDeath"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validityUnaffectedByDeathDeclaration"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c50">
      <lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡的人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销死亡宣告
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c50", "articles": ["50"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c50">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reappeared"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appliedToRevokeDeath"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c50-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>被宣告死亡的人重新出现，经本人或者利害关系人申请，人民法院应当撤销死亡宣告</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeDeathDeclaration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c51-1">
      <lrml:Comment>被宣告死亡的人的婚姻关系，自死亡宣告之日起消除
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c51-1", "articles": ["51"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c51-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredDead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageDissolved"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c51-2">
      <lrml:Comment>死亡宣告被撤销的，婚姻关系自撤销之日起自行恢复（配偶再婚或者书面声明不愿意恢复的除外）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c51-2", "articles": ["51"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c51-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRemarried"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredUnwillingToRestore"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageRestored"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c52">
      <lrml:Comment>子女在其被宣告死亡期间被依法收养的，不得以未经本人同意为由主张收养行为无效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c52", "articles": ["52"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c52">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptedDuringDeclaredDeath"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c52-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>子女在其被宣告死亡期间被依法收养的，不得以未经本人同意为由主张收养行为无效</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAdoptionVoidForLackOfConsent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-1">
      <lrml:Comment>被撤销死亡宣告的人有权请求依照继承编取得其财产的民事主体返还财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c53-1", "articles": ["53"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c53-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredUnderSuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c53-1-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimPropertyReturn"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-1b">
      <lrml:Comment>无法返还的，应当给予适当补偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c53-1b", "articles": ["53"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c53-1b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deathDeclarationRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredUnderSuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotReturn"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c53-1b-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>无法返还的，应当给予适当补偿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:giveAppropriateCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c53-2">
      <lrml:Comment>利害关系人隐瞒真实情况致使他人被宣告死亡而取得其财产的，除返还财产外，还应当赔偿损失
