    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-valid-default">
      <lrml:Comment>无无效、效力待定、确定不生效事由的，民事法律行为有效（第143条的推定）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c-valid-default", "articles": ["143"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
