    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-1">
      <lrml:Comment>自知道或应当知道撤销事由之日起一年内没有行使的，撤销权消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c152-1-1", "articles": ["152"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
