    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-1-3">
      <lrml:Comment>知道撤销事由后明确表示或者以自己的行为表明放弃撤销权的，撤销权消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c152-1-3", "articles": ["152"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-1-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:waivedRevocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c152-2">
      <lrml:Comment>自民事法律行为发生之日起五年内没有行使的，撤销权消灭（最长期间）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c152-2", "articles": ["152"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c152-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fiveYearsSinceAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c-revoke-against">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销权针对的是撤销权人与相对人之间的民事法律行为，只能向该行为的相对人主张（实施欺诈、胁迫的第三人不是撤销对象）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c-revoke-against", "articles": ["148", "149", "150"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revoke-against">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c-revoke-against-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeAgainst"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-revoked">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销权人在除斥期间内行使撤销权的，行为被撤销
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c-revoked", "articles": ["147", "155"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revoked">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesRevocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c-revocable-valid">
      <lrml:Comment>可撤销的行为在被撤销前有效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c-revocable-valid", "articles": ["147"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c-revocable-valid">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c188-run">
      <lrml:Comment>自知道或应当知道权利受损害及义务人之日起满三年，诉讼时效期间届满
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c188-run", "articles": ["188"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c188-run">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:threeYearsSinceKnew"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationInterrupted"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationSuspended"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c188-20y">
      <lrml:Comment>自权利受到损害之日起超过二十年的，人民法院不予保护；有特殊情况的可以延长
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c188-20y", "articles": ["188"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c188-20y">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twentyYearsSinceDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtExtends"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notProtectedByCourt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c192-1">
      <lrml:Comment>诉讼时效期间届满的，义务人可以提出不履行义务的抗辩（抗辩权发生主义）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c192-1", "articles": ["192"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c192-1-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationDefense"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c192-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>届满后义务人同意履行的，不得以诉讼时效期间届满为由抗辩
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c192-2a", "articles": ["192"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-2a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedToPerformAfterExpiry"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationDefense"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c192-2b">
      <lrml:Comment>届满后义务人已经自愿履行的，不得请求返还
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c192-2b", "articles": ["192"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c192-2b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyPerformed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restitutionClaim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c193">
      <lrml:Comment>人民法院不得主动适用诉讼时效的规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c193", "articles": ["193"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c193">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtHears"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c193-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>人民法院不得主动适用诉讼时效的规定</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyLimitationExOfficio"/>
                <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c194">
      <lrml:Comment>最后六个月内因法定障碍不能行使请求权的，诉讼时效中止
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c194", "articles": ["194"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c194">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withinLastSixMonths"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forceMajeure"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incapableClaimantWithoutAgent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirOrAdministratorUndetermined"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimantControlledByObligor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherObstacle"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationSuspended"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c195">
      <lrml:Comment>权利人请求履行、义务人同意履行、起诉或申请仲裁等，诉讼时效中断、重新计算
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c195", "articles": ["195"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c195">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorDemandsPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorAgreesToPerform"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suitOrArbitrationFiled"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:equivalentProceeding"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitationInterrupted"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c196">
      <lrml:Comment>停止侵害、排除妨碍、消除危险，不动产及登记动产物权人请求返还，抚养费赡养费扶养费等不适用诉讼时效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c196", "articles": ["196"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c196">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seeksCessationOrRemoval"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnOfImmovableOrRegisteredMovable"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportOrMaintenancePayment"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:statutorilyExempt"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptFromLimitation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c399">
      <lrml:Comment>土地所有权、集体土地使用权（法律另有规定除外）、公益设施、权属争议、被查封扣押监管的财产不得抵押
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c399", "articles": ["399"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c399">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landOwnership"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:And>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:collectiveLandUseRight"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Naf>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawPermitsMortgage"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
              </ruleml:Naf>
            </ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:publicWelfareFacility"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disputedOwnership"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seizedOrSupervised"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageBannedByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonMortgageable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c395">
      <lrml:Comment>债务人或第三人有权处分的、法律未禁止抵押的财产可以抵押
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c395", "articles": ["395"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c395">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hasDisposalPower"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
