    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c423">
      <lrml:Comment>约定期间届满、无约定满二年请求确定、不可能发生新债权、知道查封扣押、破产解散等，债权确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c423", "articles": ["423"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
