    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c226-delivery">
      <lrml:Comment>买受人已经占有标的物的（如借用、租赁中买下），买卖合同生效时视为交付（简易交付），风险随之转移
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c226-delivery", "articles": ["226", "604"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c226-delivery">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerAlreadyPossesses"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c604-price">
      <lrml:Comment>风险由买受人承担的，标的物意外毁损灭失后，买受人仍须支付价款
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c604-price", "articles": ["604"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c604-price">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodsPerished"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c604-price-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>风险由买受人承担的，标的物意外毁损灭失后，买受人仍须支付价款</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payPrice"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c725">
      <lrml:Comment>承租人依约占有期间租赁物所有权变动的，不影响租赁合同的效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c725", "articles": ["725"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c725">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantPossessesUnderLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownershipChanged"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseBindsNewOwner"/>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c726">
      <lrml:Comment>出租人出卖租赁房屋的，承租人享有以同等条件优先购买的权利；按份共有人行使优先购买权或出卖给近亲属的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c726", "articles": ["726"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordSells"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOwnerExercisesPreemption"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:saleToCloseRelative"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c726-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preemptionRight"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c726-notify">
      <lrml:Comment>出租人应当在出卖之前的合理期限内通知承租人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c726-notify", "articles": ["726"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726-notify">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordSells"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c726-notify-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出租人应当在出卖之前的合理期限内通知承租人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyTenantBeforeSale"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c726-2">
      <lrml:Comment>出租人履行通知义务后，承租人在十五日内未明确表示购买的，视为放弃优先购买权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c726-2", "articles": ["726"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c726-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantNotifiedOfSale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAnswerWithin15Days"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preemptionRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1062">
      <lrml:Comment>婚姻关系存续期间所得的工资、经营投资收益、知识产权收益、继承或受赠的财产等为夫妻共同财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1062", "articles": ["1062"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1062">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredDuringMarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wagesOrRemuneration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:businessOrInvestmentIncome"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ipIncome"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritedOrGifted"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherCommonProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1063">
      <lrml:Comment>婚前财产、人身损害赔偿或补偿、遗嘱或赠与合同中确定只归一方的财产、一方专用生活用品为个人财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1063", "articles": ["1063"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1063">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:premaritalProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalInjuryCompensation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designatedSolelyToOneSpouse"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalUseItem"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherSeparateProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separateProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-joint">
      <lrml:Comment>共同签名或一方事后追认等共同意思表示所负的债务，属于夫妻共同债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1064-joint", "articles": ["1064"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-joint">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bothSigned"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRatified"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-daily">
      <lrml:Comment>一方在婚姻关系存续期间以个人名义为家庭日常生活需要所负的债务，属于夫妻共同债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1064-daily", "articles": ["1064"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-daily">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incurredDuringMarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inOwnName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forDailyHouseholdNeeds"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-2">
      <lrml:Comment>超出家庭日常生活需要所负的债务，不属于夫妻共同债务；但债权人能证明用于共同生活、共同生产经营或基于共同意思表示的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1064-2", "articles": ["1064"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incurredDuringMarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inOwnName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsDailyNeeds"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bothSigned"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRatified"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorProvesCommonUse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1064-2-proof">
      <lrml:Comment>债权人能够证明用于夫妻共同生活、共同生产经营或基于共同意思表示的，属于共同债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1064-2-proof", "articles": ["1064"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1064-2-proof">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorProvesCommonUse"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointMaritalDebt"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Z</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1123-agreement">
      <lrml:Comment>有遗赠扶养协议的，按照协议办理（效力最优先）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1123-agreement", "articles": ["1123"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1123-agreement">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAgreementCovers"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byAgreement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1123-will">
      <lrml:Comment>有遗嘱的，按照遗嘱继承或者遗赠办理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1123-will", "articles": ["1123"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
