    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1202">
      <lrml:Comment>因产品存在缺陷造成他人损害的，生产者应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1202", "articles": ["1202"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
