      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1203-2b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectiveProduct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:producer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seller"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defectCausedBySellerFault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Pr</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidVictim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1203-2b-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Se</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1245">
      <lrml:Comment>饲养的动物造成他人损害的，动物饲养人或者管理人应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1245", "articles": ["1245"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1245">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1245-def">
      <lrml:Comment>能够证明损害是因被侵权人故意或者重大过失造成的，可以不承担或者减轻责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1245-def", "articles": ["1245"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1245-def">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimGrossNegligence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1246">
      <lrml:Comment>违反管理规定未采取安全措施的，被侵权人重大过失不再减免责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1246", "articles": ["1246"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1246">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatedRulesNoSafetyMeasures"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1246-reduce">
      <lrml:Comment>违反管理规定的，只有被侵权人故意才可以减轻责任（不能免除）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1246-reduce", "articles": ["1246"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1246-reduce">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatedRulesNoSafetyMeasures"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayReduceOnly"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1247">
      <lrml:Comment>禁止饲养的烈性犬等危险动物造成他人损害的，应当承担侵权责任（无免责事由）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1247", "articles": ["1247"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1247">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperOrManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bannedDangerousAnimal"/>
              <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayExemptOrReduce"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mayReduceOnly"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1253">
      <lrml:Comment>建筑物等及其搁置物、悬挂物脱落、坠落造成损害，所有人、管理人或者使用人不能证明自己没有过错的，应当承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1253", "articles": ["1253"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1253">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fallingObjectFrom"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Bd</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerManagerOrUser"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Bd</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNoFault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-known">
      <lrml:Comment>从建筑物中抛掷物品或坠落物品造成他人损害的，由侵权人依法承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1254-known", "articles": ["1254"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-known">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:identifiedTortfeasor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1254-unknown">
      <lrml:Comment>难以确定具体侵权人的，除能够证明自己不是侵权人的外，由可能加害的建筑物使用人给予补偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1254-unknown", "articles": ["1254"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-unknown">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:possibleBuildingUser"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortfeasorIdentified"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNotTortfeasor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1254-unknown-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>难以确定具体侵权人的，除能够证明自己不是侵权人的外，由可能加害的建筑物使用人给予补偿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensationShare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-known-flag">
      <lrml:Comment>已查明具体侵权人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1254-known-flag", "articles": ["1254"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-known-flag">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:identifiedTortfeasor"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortfeasorIdentified"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1254-2">
      <lrml:Comment>物业服务企业等建筑物管理人未采取必要的安全保障措施的，承担未履行安全保障义务的侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1254-2", "articles": ["1254"], "provenance": {"kind": "existing_formal_rule"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1254-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectThrownOrFell"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buildingManager"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noNecessarySafetyMeasures"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Pm</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c161-1">
      <lrml:Comment>民事主体可以通过代理人实施民事法律行为
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c161-1", "articles": ["161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g1696", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：沿用了已有谓词 actOf/2（词表释义为“民事法律行为（行为人）”），按（行为，行为人）的参数顺序使用，请确认顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第174条第1、2款的情形分别用了两组已有谓词（agentUnawareOfDeath/heirsRecognize/performedBeforeDeathForHeirs 和 agentUnawareOfPrincipalEnd/successorRatifies/performedBeforeEndForSuccessorInterest），两组参数顺序不完全一致\n  · 起草者提示：“代理行为有效”写成 valid(X)，没有写成 bindsPrincipal(X,P)；第164条第2款的连带责任写成代理人和相对人各自一条 OBL（content 相同），是一种取舍\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c161-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mustBePerformedInPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c161-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>民事主体可以通过代理人实施民事法律行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actThroughAgent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c161-ground">
      <lrml:Comment>依照法律规定、当事人约定或者民事法律行为的性质，应当由本人亲自实施
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c161-ground", "articles": ["161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g1696", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：沿用了已有谓词 actOf/2（词表释义为“民事法律行为（行为人）”），按（行为，行为人）的参数顺序使用，请确认顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第174条第1、2款的情形分别用了两组已有谓词（agentUnawareOfDeath/heirsRecognize/performedBeforeDeathForHeirs 和 agentUnawareOfPrincipalEnd/successorRatifies/performedBeforeEndForSuccessorInterest），两组参数顺序不完全一致\n  · 起草者提示：“代理行为有效”写成 valid(X)，没有写成 bindsPrincipal(X,P)；第164条第2款的连带责任写成代理人和相对人各自一条 OBL（content 相同），是一种取舍\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c161-ground">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalByLaw"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalByAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:personalByNature"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mustBePerformedInPerson"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c161-2">
      <lrml:Comment>应当由本人亲自实施的民事法律行为，不得代理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c161-2", "articles": ["161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g1696", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：沿用了已有谓词 actOf/2（词表释义为“民事法律行为（行为人）”），按（行为，行为人）的参数顺序使用，请确认顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第174条第1、2款的情形分别用了两组已有谓词（agentUnawareOfDeath/heirsRecognize/performedBeforeDeathForHeirs 和 agentUnawareOfPrincipalEnd/successorRatifies/performedBeforeEndForSuccessorInterest），两组参数顺序不完全一致\n  · 起草者提示：“代理行为有效”写成 valid(X)，没有写成 bindsPrincipal(X,P)；第164条第2款的连带责任写成代理人和相对人各自一条 OBL（content 相同），是一种取舍\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c161-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mustBePerformedInPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c161-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>应当由本人亲自实施的民事法律行为，不得代理</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
