    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c178-srcg0589">
      <lrml:Comment>连带责任由法律规定或者当事人约定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c178-srcg0589", "articles": ["178"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c178-srcg0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiesAgreedJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiability"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c178-extg0589">
      <lrml:Comment>权利人有权请求部分或者全部连带责任人承担责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c178-extg0589", "articles": ["178"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c178-extg0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:rightHolderAgainst"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:memberOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c178-extg0589-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimPerformanceFrom"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c178-shg0589">
      <lrml:Comment>连带责任人的责任份额根据各自责任大小确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c178-shg0589", "articles": ["178"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c178-shg0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:memberOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liabilityShareDeterminable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shareDeterminedByFault"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c178-eqg0589">
      <lrml:Comment>难以确定责任大小的，平均承担责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c178-eqg0589", "articles": ["178"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c178-eqg0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:memberOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liabilityShareIndeterminable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:equalShare"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c178-recg0589">
      <lrml:Comment>实际承担责任超过自己份额的连带责任人，有权向其他连带责任人追偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c178-recg0589", "articles": ["178"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c178-recg0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:memberOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actualPerformanceExceedsShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherMember"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c178-recg0589-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimRecourseAgainst"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c179-2g0589">
      <lrml:Comment>法律规定惩罚性赔偿的，依照其规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c179-2g0589", "articles": ["179"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c179-2g0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearsLiabilityFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesPunitiveDamages"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c179-2g0589-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>法律规定惩罚性赔偿的，依照其规定</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payPunitiveDamagesPerLaw"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c179-3g0589">
      <lrml:Comment>第179条第1款所列十一种承担民事责任的方式，可以单独适用，也可以合并适用
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c179-3g0589", "articles": ["179"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c179-3g0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearsLiabilityFor"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c179-3g0589-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>第179条第1款所列十一种承担民事责任的方式，可以单独适用，也可以合并适用</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyLiabilityModesSeparatelyOrCombined"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c187-1g0589">
      <lrml:Comment>因同一行为承担行政责任或者刑事责任，不影响承担民事责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c187-1g0589", "articles": ["187"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c187-1g0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilLiabilityForAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adminOrCriminalLiabilityForAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c187-1g0589-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>因同一行为承担行政责任或者刑事责任，不影响承担民事责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearCivilLiabilityForAct"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c187-2g0589">
      <lrml:Comment>民事主体的财产不足以支付的，优先用于承担民事责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c187-2g0589", "articles": ["187"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0589", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第179条第1款十一种责任方式只在 nl 中列举，形式化仅保留“可单独或合并适用”和惩罚性赔偿两条\n  · 起草者提示：第187条用 OBL 承担民事责任，加 civilLiabilityPaidFirst 表达财产不足时民事责任优先\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c187-2g0589">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilLiabilityForAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adminOrCriminalLiabilityForAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyInsufficientForAllLiabilities"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilLiabilityPaidFirst"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1166">
      <lrml:Comment>行为人造成他人民事权益损害，不论有无过错，法律规定应当承担侵权责任的，依照其规定承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1166", "articles": ["1166"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1166", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1166">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:strictLiabilityByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1167">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权行为危及他人人身、财产安全的，被侵权人有权请求侵权人承担停止侵害、排除妨碍、消除危险等侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1167", "articles": ["1167"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1167", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1167">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:endangersPersonOrProperty"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1167-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestStopRemoveEliminate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1173">
      <lrml:Comment>被侵权人对同一损害的发生或者扩大有过错的，可以减轻侵权人的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1173", "articles": ["1173"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0638", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1174（受害人故意免责）覆盖 c1165-1、c1165-2、c1166，另用学理规则排除饲养动物致害（第1245–1247条），是否还有其他“另有规定”需排除\n  · 起草者提示：c1173 直接用 fault(V,X) 表示被侵权人过错\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1173">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liabilityMayBeReduced"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1174">
      <lrml:Comment>损害是因受害人故意造成的，行为人不承担责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1174", "articles": ["1174"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0638", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1174（受害人故意免责）覆盖 c1165-1、c1165-2、c1166，另用学理规则排除饲养动物致害（第1245–1247条），是否还有其他“另有规定”需排除\n  · 起草者提示：c1173 直接用 fault(V,X) 表示被侵权人过错\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1174">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntentGovernedBySpecialRule"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1174-special">
      <lrml:Comment>学理（笔记 g0638“除了饲养动物受害人故意是减轻责任，其它都是免责”）：饲养动物损害责任就受害人故意另有第1245—1247条特别规定，排除第1174条的一般免责
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1174-special", "articles": ["1174"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0638", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1174（受害人故意免责）覆盖 c1165-1、c1165-2、c1166，另用学理规则排除饲养动物致害（第1245–1247条），是否还有其他“另有规定”需排除\n  · 起草者提示：c1173 直接用 fault(V,X) 表示被侵权人过错\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1174-special">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:animalDamage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>An</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimIntentGovernedBySpecialRule"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1168-def">
      <lrml:Comment>学理（笔记 g7513 数人侵权·共同侵权构成要件）：主体复数且具有共同故意、共同过失或故意过失混合的意思联络，即构成共同侵权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1168-def", "articles": ["1168"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1168-def">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortActorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:multipleTortActors"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commonFaultAmongActors"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointTortParticipant"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1168">
      <lrml:Comment>二人以上共同实施侵权行为，造成他人损害的，应当承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1168", "articles": ["1168"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1168">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointTortParticipant"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1169-1">
      <lrml:Comment>教唆、帮助他人实施侵权行为的，应当与行为人承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-1", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1169-2">
      <lrml:Comment>教唆、帮助无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人实施侵权行为的，应当承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-2", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1169-2g">
      <lrml:Comment>该无民事行为能力人、限制民事行为能力人的监护人未尽到监护职责的，应当承担相应的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-2g", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-2g">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianDutyFulfilled"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:correspondingLiability"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1169-spc11">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉侵权责任编的解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）第11条：教唆人、帮助人以不知道且不应当知道行为人为无/限制民事行为能力人为由主张不担责或仅与监护人承担连带责任的，不予支持
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-spc11", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-spc11">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:limitedCapacity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unawareOfActorIncapacity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1169-spc12">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第12条：被侵权人合并请求时，教唆人、帮助人承担侵权责任，监护人在未尽到监护职责的范围内与其共同承担责任，各主体实际支付总额不超出被侵权人应受偿的损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-spc12", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-spc12">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:correspondingLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1169-spc12r">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第12条：监护人先行支付赔偿费用后，就超过自己相应责任的部分向教唆人、帮助人追偿的，人民法院应予支持
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1169-spc12r", "articles": ["1169"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7513", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1170-excl（能确定具体侵权人时其余危险行为人不负连带责任）标为学理；c1169-1 用 ~noCapacity/~limitedCapacity 把行为能力欠缺交给第2款\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1169-spc12r">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatesOrAids"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guardianOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
