    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1195-1">
      <lrml:Comment>网络用户利用网络服务实施侵权行为的，权利人有权通知网络服务提供者采取删除、屏蔽、断开链接等必要措施
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1195-1", "articles": ["1195"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1195", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1195-3 错误通知责任保留“法律另有规定”的但书（如《电子商务法》第42条），未展开\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1195-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkServiceTort"/>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1195-1-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyToTakeNecessaryMeasures"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1195-notice">
      <lrml:Comment>通知应当包括构成侵权的初步证据及权利人的真实身份信息
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1195-notice", "articles": ["1195"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1195", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1195-3 错误通知责任保留“法律另有规定”的但书（如《电子商务法》第42条），未展开\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1195-notice">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noticeSent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noticeContainsEvidenceAndIdentity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1195-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>网络服务提供者接到通知后，应当及时将该通知转送相关网络用户，并根据构成侵权的初步证据和服务类型采取必要措施
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1195-2a", "articles": ["1195"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1195", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1195-3 错误通知责任保留“法律另有规定”的但书（如《电子商务法》第42条），未展开\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1195-2a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkServiceTort"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1195-2a-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>网络服务提供者接到通知后，应当及时将该通知转送相关网络用户，并根据构成侵权的初步证据和服务类型采取必要措施</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forwardNoticeTimely"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1195-2a-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>网络服务提供者接到通知后，应当及时将该通知转送相关网络用户，并根据构成侵权的初步证据和服务类型采取必要措施</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:takeNecessaryMeasures"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1195-2b">
      <lrml:Comment>未及时采取必要措施的，对损害的扩大部分与该网络用户承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1195-2b", "articles": ["1195"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1195", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1195-3 错误通知责任保留“法律另有规定”的但书（如《电子商务法》第42条），未展开\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1195-2b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkServiceTort"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessaryMeasuresTaken"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiabilityForExpandedDamage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1195-3">
      <lrml:Comment>权利人因错误通知造成网络用户或者网络服务提供者损害的，应当承担侵权责任；法律另有规定的，依照其规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1195-3", "articles": ["1195"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1195", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1195-3 错误通知责任保留“法律另有规定”的但书（如《电子商务法》第42条），未展开\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1195-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wrongfulNoticeCausesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnWrongfulNotice"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1194">
      <lrml:Comment>网络用户、网络服务提供者利用网络侵害他人民事权益的，应当承担侵权责任；法律另有规定的，依照其规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1194", "articles": ["1194"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1194", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1194">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkUser"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkServiceProvider"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesViaNetwork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnNetworkTort"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1190-1">
      <lrml:Comment>完全民事行为能力人对自己的行为暂时没有意识或者失去控制造成他人损害有过错的，应当承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1190-1", "articles": ["1190"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1190-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:temporaryLossOfConsciousnessOrControl"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1190-1b">
      <lrml:Comment>没有过错的，根据行为人的经济状况对受害人适当补偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1190-1b", "articles": ["1190"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1190-1b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:temporaryLossOfConsciousnessOrControl"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intoxicationOrDrugAbuseCaused"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1190-1b-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>没有过错的，根据行为人的经济状况对受害人适当补偿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:giveAppropriateCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1190-2">
      <lrml:Comment>因醉酒、滥用麻醉药品或者精神药品对自己的行为暂时没有意识或者失去控制造成他人损害的，应当承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1190-2", "articles": ["1190"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1190-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fullCapacity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:temporaryLossOfConsciousnessOrControl"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intoxicationOrDrugAbuseCaused"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1191-spc15">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉侵权责任编的解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）第15条第2款：个体工商户的从业人员因执行工作任务造成他人损害的，适用民法典第1191条第1款
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1191-spc15", "articles": ["1191"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-spc15">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:individualBusinessEmployee"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employeeOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1191-spc16">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第16条：用工单位承担侵权责任，劳务派遣单位在不当选派工作人员、未依法履行培训义务等过错范围内与用工单位共同承担责任，实际支付总额不超出应受偿损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1191-spc16", "articles": ["1191"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-spc16">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchedWorker"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hostEmployer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchAgency"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performingDuties"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1191-spc16r">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第16条：劳务派遣单位先行支付赔偿费用后，就超过自己相应责任的部分向用工单位追偿的，予以支持，但双方另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1191-spc16r", "articles": ["1191"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1191-spc16r">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:hostEmployer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dispatchAgency"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidVictim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiesAgreedOtherwiseOnRecourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1191-spc16r-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Dp</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1192-1">
      <lrml:Comment>个人之间形成劳务关系，提供劳务一方因劳务造成他人损害的，由接受劳务一方承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1192-1", "articles": ["1192"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1192-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborProviderFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1192-recourse">
      <lrml:Comment>接受劳务一方承担侵权责任后，可以向有故意或者重大过失的提供劳务一方追偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1192-recourse", "articles": ["1192"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1192-recourse">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborProviderFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentional"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grossNegligence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1192-recourse-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1192-self">
      <lrml:Comment>提供劳务一方因劳务受到损害的，根据双方各自的过错承担相应的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1192-self", "articles": ["1192"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1192-self">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborProviderFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liabilityPerRespectiveFault"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1192-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>提供劳务期间，因第三人的行为造成提供劳务一方损害的，提供劳务一方有权请求第三人承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1192-2a", "articles": ["1192"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
