    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1192-2c">
      <lrml:Comment>接受劳务一方补偿后，可以向第三人追偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1192-2c", "articles": ["1192"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1192-2c">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:laborProviderFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageCausedByThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:indemnifiedLaborProvider"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1192-2c-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1193-1">
      <lrml:Comment>承揽人在完成工作过程中造成第三人损害或者自己损害的，定作人不承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1193-1", "articles": ["1193"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1193-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageDuringContractedWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultInOrderInstructionOrSelection"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1193-2">
      <lrml:Comment>但是，定作人对定作、指示或者选任有过错的，应当承担相应的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1193-2", "articles": ["1193"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1193-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageDuringContractedWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultInOrderInstructionOrSelection"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:correspondingLiability"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1193-spc18">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第18条：承揽人造成第三人损害，依第1165条认定承揽人责任；被侵权人合并请求时，定作人在定作、指示或者选任过错范围内与承揽人共同承担责任，实际支付总额不超出应受偿损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1193-spc18", "articles": ["1193"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1193-spc18">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageDuringContractedWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherThan"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultInOrderInstructionOrSelection"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1193-spc18r">
      <lrml:Comment>侵权编解释（一）第18条：定作人先行支付赔偿费用后，就超过自己相应责任的部分向承揽人追偿的，予以支持，但双方另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1193-spc18r", "articles": ["1193"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7611", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记把第1192条第2款写成“请求接受劳务一方承担侵权责任（连带）”，与法条“给予补偿”不符，规则按法条写\n  · 起草者提示：c1192-1 推出提供劳务一方不承担责任并覆盖 c1165-1；引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1193-spc18r">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableTogetherWithinFaultScope"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidBeyondOwnShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiesAgreedOtherwiseOnRecourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1193-spc18r-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1197">
      <lrml:Comment>网络服务提供者知道或者应当知道网络用户利用其网络服务侵害他人民事权益，未采取必要措施的，与该网络用户承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1197", "articles": ["1197"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7647", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1198条第2款写成“补充责任＋不承担直接责任”并优先于第1款（仿基础规则 c1201-supp）\n  · 起草者提示：第1197条“未采取必要措施”用须证得的否定（-），不是“除非”（~）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1197">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:networkServiceTort"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:knewOrShouldKnowInfringement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessaryMeasuresTaken"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tortJointLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1198-1">
      <lrml:Comment>经营场所、公共场所的经营者、管理者或者群众性活动的组织者，未尽到安全保障义务，造成他人损害的，应当承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1198-1", "articles": ["1198"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7647", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1198条第2款写成“补充责任＋不承担直接责任”并优先于第1款（仿基础规则 c1201-supp）\n  · 起草者提示：第1197条“未采取必要措施”用须证得的否定（-），不是“除非”（~）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1198-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityObligorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failedSecurityDuty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1198-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>因第三人的行为造成他人损害的，由第三人承担侵权责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1198-2a", "articles": ["1198"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7647", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1198条第2款写成“补充责任＋不承担直接责任”并优先于第1款（仿基础规则 c1201-supp）\n  · 起草者提示：第1197条“未采取必要措施”用须证得的否定（-），不是“除非”（~）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1198-2a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityObligorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageCausedByThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1198-2b">
      <lrml:Comment>经营者、管理者或者组织者未尽到安全保障义务的，承担相应的补充责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1198-2b", "articles": ["1198"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7647", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1198条第2款写成“补充责任＋不承担直接责任”并优先于第1款（仿基础规则 c1201-supp）\n  · 起草者提示：第1197条“未采取必要措施”用须证得的否定（-），不是“除非”（~）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1198-2b">
        <ruleml:if>
