              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplementaryLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1198-2c">
      <lrml:Comment>经营者、管理者或者组织者承担补充责任后，可以向第三人追偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1198-2c", "articles": ["1198"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7647", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1198条第2款写成“补充责任＋不承担直接责任”并优先于第1款（仿基础规则 c1201-supp）\n  · 起草者提示：第1197条“未采取必要措施”用须证得的否定（-），不是“除非”（~）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1198-2c">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplementaryLiability"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageCausedByThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidVictim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1198-2c-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recourse"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1196-1">
      <lrml:Comment>网络用户接到转送的通知后，可以向网络服务提供者提交不存在侵权行为的声明
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1196-1", "articles": ["1196"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1196", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1196-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forwardNoticeReceived"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1196-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>网络用户接到转送的通知后，可以向网络服务提供者提交不存在侵权行为的声明</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:submitNonInfringementDeclaration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1196-decl">
      <lrml:Comment>声明应当包括不存在侵权行为的初步证据及网络用户的真实身份信息
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1196-decl", "articles": ["1196"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1196", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1196-decl">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declarationSubmitted"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declarationContainsEvidenceAndIdentity"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validNonInfringementDeclaration"/>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1196-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>网络服务提供者接到声明后，应当将该声明转送发出通知的权利人，并告知其可以向有关部门投诉或者向人民法院提起诉讼
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1196-2a", "articles": ["1196"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1196", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1196-2a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validNonInfringementDeclaration"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1196-2a-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>网络服务提供者接到声明后，应当将该声明转送发出通知的权利人，并告知其可以向有关部门投诉或者向人民法院提起诉讼</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forwardDeclarationAndInformRemedies"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1196-2b">
      <lrml:Comment>在转送声明到达权利人后的合理期限内，未收到权利人已经投诉或者提起诉讼通知的，应当及时终止所采取的措施
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1196-2b", "articles": ["1196"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1196", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1196-2b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validTakedownNotice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validNonInfringementDeclaration"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declarationReachedRightHolder"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reasonablePeriodElapsed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:complaintOrSuitNoticeReceived"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1196-2b-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>在转送声明到达权利人后的合理期限内，未收到权利人已经投诉或者提起诉讼通知的，应当及时终止所采取的措施</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminateMeasuresTimely"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1183-1">
      <lrml:Comment>侵害自然人人身权益造成严重精神损害的，被侵权人有权请求精神损害赔偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1183-1", "articles": ["1183"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7418", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1183-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesPersonalRightsOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriousMentalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1183-1-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimMentalDamageCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1183-2">
      <lrml:Comment>因故意或者重大过失侵害自然人具有人身意义的特定物造成严重精神损害的，被侵权人有权请求精神损害赔偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1183-2", "articles": ["1183"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7418", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1183-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damagesPersonallySignificantObject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentional"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grossNegligence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriousMentalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1183-2-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimMentalDamageCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1183-spc2">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉侵权责任编的解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）第2条：非法使被监护人脱离监护，导致父母子女关系或者其他近亲属关系受到严重损害的，应当认定为第1183条第1款规定的严重精神损害
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1183-spc2", "articles": ["1183"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7418", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引用的《侵权责任编解释（一）》（法释〔2024〕12号）条文是转述，未逐字核对，请对照原文\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1183-spc2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:illegallySeparatesWardFromGuardianship"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:kinshipSeriouslyHarmed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringesPersonalRightsOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriousMentalDamage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1186">
      <lrml:Comment>受害人和行为人对损害的发生都没有过错的，依照法律的规定由双方分担损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1186", "articles": ["1186"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7399", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1186-strict（适用无过错责任时不分担损失）来自笔记，标为学理并覆盖 c1186\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1186">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesLossSharing"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lossSharedByLaw"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
