    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1186-strict">
      <lrml:Comment>学理（笔记 g7473“法定分担损失规则”条件(2)）：损害不属于适用无过错责任原则的情形，方可分担损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1186-strict", "articles": ["1186"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7399", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1186-strict（适用无过错责任时不分担损失）来自笔记，标为学理并覆盖 c1186\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1186-strict">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmfulAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:strictLiabilityByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lossSharedByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1179-1">
      <lrml:Comment>侵害他人造成人身损害的，应当赔偿医疗费、护理费、交通费、营养费、住院伙食补助费等为治疗和康复支出的合理费用，以及因误工减少的收入
