          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimsTermination"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suitOrArbitrationFiled"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtConfirmsTerminationClaim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:complaintCopyServed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationEffective"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c564-lapse">
      <lrml:Comment>法律规定或者当事人约定解除权行使期限，期限届满当事人不行使的，该权利消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c564-lapse", "articles": ["564"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4624", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记说未约定异议期的须在解除通知到达之日起三个月内起诉。这一规则出自原《合同法解释（二）》第24条，该解释已随民法典施行废止，所以没有形式化，只在 distinguish 中说明，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：通知解除、自动解除、诉讼解除三条规则的规则体都加了 terminationRight(P,K)（即须“依法”享有解除权），比 card:g4589 中第565条的写法更严，两行不一致\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c564-lapse">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationPeriodSet"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationPeriodExpiredUnexercised"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c564-lapse2">
      <lrml:Comment>无规定或约定期限的，自知道或应当知道解除事由之日起一年内不行使，或经对方催告后合理期限内不行使的，解除权消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c564-lapse2", "articles": ["564"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4624", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记说未约定异议期的须在解除通知到达之日起三个月内起诉。这一规则出自原《合同法解释（二）》第24条，该解释已随民法典施行废止，所以没有形式化，只在 distinguish 中说明，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：通知解除、自动解除、诉讼解除三条规则的规则体都加了 terminationRight(P,K)（即须“依法”享有解除权），比 card:g4589 中第565条的写法更严，两行不一致\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c564-lapse2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationPeriodSet"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationUnexercisedOneYearAfterKnowing"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationUnexercisedAfterDemand"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c566-stop">
      <lrml:Comment>合同解除后，尚未履行的，终止履行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c566-stop", "articles": ["566"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4640", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第566条第1款“根据履行情况和合同性质”没有拆成条件，只合并为一个请求恢复原状或其他补救措施的权利，在 note 中说明\n  · 起草者提示：损害赔偿条件写作 lossRelatedToTermination，赔偿范围（是否含可得利益）请专家确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c566-stop">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligationUnperformedAtTermination"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performanceCeases"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c566-restore">
      <lrml:Comment>已经履行的，根据履行情况和合同性质，当事人可以请求恢复原状或者采取其他补救措施（具体方式由履行情况和合同性质决定）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c566-restore", "articles": ["566"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4640", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第566条第1款“根据履行情况和合同性质”没有拆成条件，只合并为一个请求恢复原状或其他补救措施的权利，在 note 中说明\n  · 起草者提示：损害赔偿条件写作 lossRelatedToTermination，赔偿范围（是否含可得利益）请专家确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c566-restore">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performedBeforeTermination"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c566-restore-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestRestitutionOrOtherRemedy"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c566-damages">
      <lrml:Comment>合同解除后，当事人有权请求赔偿损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c566-damages", "articles": ["566"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4640", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第566条第1款“根据履行情况和合同性质”没有拆成条件，只合并为一个请求恢复原状或其他补救措施的权利，在 note 中说明\n  · 起草者提示：损害赔偿条件写作 lossRelatedToTermination，赔偿范围（是否含可得利益）请专家确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
