    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c566-breach">
      <lrml:Comment>合同因违约解除的，解除权人可以请求违约方承担违约责任，当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c566-breach", "articles": ["566"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4640", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第566条第1款“根据履行情况和合同性质”没有拆成条件，只合并为一个请求恢复原状或其他补救措施的权利，在 note 中说明\n  · 起草者提示：损害赔偿条件写作 lossRelatedToTermination，赔偿范围（是否含可得利益）请专家确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c566-breach">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminatedForBreach"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachingParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnPostTerminationLiability"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c566-breach-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimBreachLiabilityAfterTermination"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c566-security">
      <lrml:Comment>主合同解除后，担保人对债务人应当承担的民事责任仍应当承担担保责任，担保合同另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c566-security", "articles": ["566"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4640", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第566条第1款“根据履行情况和合同性质”没有拆成条件，只合并为一个请求恢复原状或其他补救措施的权利，在 note 中说明\n  · 起草者提示：损害赔偿条件写作 lossRelatedToTermination，赔偿范围（是否含可得利益）请专家确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c566-security">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityProviderForMainContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityContractProvidesOtherwise"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c566-security-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>主合同解除后，担保人对债务人应当承担的民事责任仍应当承担担保责任，担保合同另有约定的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:continueSecurityLiabilityAfterTermination"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c502-effg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>依法成立的合同，自成立时生效，但是法律另有规定或者当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c502-effg4138", "articles": ["502"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c502-effg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawfullyFormed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnTakingEffect"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiesAgreedOtherwiseOnEffect"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c502-noapprovalg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>依照法律、行政法规应当办理批准等手续的，依照其规定；未办理且影响合同生效的，合同不生效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c502-noapprovalg4138", "articles": ["502"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c502-noapprovalg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawfullyFormed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalRequiredByLawsAndRegulations"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalFailureAffectsEffect"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c502-clauseg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>未办理批准等手续影响合同生效的，不影响合同中履行报批等义务条款以及相关条款的效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c502-clauseg4138", "articles": ["502"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c502-clauseg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalFailureAffectsEffect"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalClauseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c502-liabg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>应当办理申请批准等手续的当事人未履行义务的，对方可以请求其承担违反该义务的责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c502-liabg4138", "articles": ["502"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c502-liabg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalObligor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsToPerformApprovalObligation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalObligor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c502-liabg4138-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimLiabilityForApprovalBreach"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c502-changeg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>合同的变更、转让、解除等情形依法应当办理批准等手续的，适用前款规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c502-changeg4138", "articles": ["502"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c502-changeg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractChange"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalRequiredByLawsAndRegulations"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvalRulesApply"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c503-ratifyg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>无权代理人以被代理人的名义订立合同，被代理人已经开始履行合同义务或者接受相对人履行的，视为对合同的追认
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c503-ratifyg4138", "articles": ["503"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c503-ratifyg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inPrincipalName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:principalBeganPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:principalAcceptedCounterpartyPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedRatifiedContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c504-validg4138">
      <lrml:Comment>法定代表人或者非法人组织负责人超越权限订立的合同，除相对人知道或者应当知道其超越权限外，代表行为有效，合同对法人或者非法人组织发生效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c504-validg4138", "articles": ["504"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4138", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第502条第2款中，未办理批准、影响生效的合同写成 -contractEffective(K)，并声明优先于成立即生效的一般规则；“报批条款仍有效”写成 valid(C)\n  · 起草者提示：第503条“视为追认”用了新谓词 deemedRatifiedContract(P,K)，没有沿用已有的 ratified/2：它的释义列了三个参数，实际只有 2 个，含义不清\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c504-validg4138">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legalRepresentativeOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:headOfUnincorporatedOrg"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actInOrgName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsRepresentationAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyKnowsOrShouldKnowExcess"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bindsOrg"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c504-validg4149">
      <lrml:Comment>法定代表人或者非法人组织负责人超越权限订立的合同，除相对人知道或者应当知道其超越权限外，代表行为有效，合同对法人或者非法人组织发生效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c504-validg4149", "articles": ["504"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c504-validg4149">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legalRepresentativeOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:headOfUnincorporatedOrg"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actInOrgName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsRepresentationAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyKnowsOrShouldKnowExcess"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bindsOrg"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c505-lawg4149">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人超越经营范围订立的合同的效力，依照第一编第六章第三节和合同编的有关规定确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c505-lawg4149", "articles": ["505"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c505-lawg4149">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsBusinessScope"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
