          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c505-nottg4149">
      <lrml:Comment>不得仅以超越经营范围确认合同无效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c505-nottg4149", "articles": ["505"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c505-nottg4149">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsBusinessScope"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c505-nottg4149-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>不得仅以超越经营范围确认合同无效</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declareVoidSolelyForExceedingScope"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c598-main">
      <lrml:Comment>出卖人应当履行向买受人交付标的物或者交付提取标的物的单证，并转移标的物所有权的义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c598-main", "articles": ["598"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4882", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第609条写成“已交付且未交付单证资料时风险仍由买受人承担”，与基础规则 c604-after 重复，只用来表达“未交单证不构成例外”；风险用 riskOnBuyer(K)，以合同为参数，与基础规则一致\n  · 起草者提示：“不动产以登记、动产以交付转移所有权”只写进 nl，未形式化\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c598-main">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c598-main-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出卖人应当履行向买受人交付标的物或者交付提取标的物的单证，并转移标的物所有权的义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deliverThingOrTakeDeliveryDocuments"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c598-main-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出卖人应当履行向买受人交付标的物或者交付提取标的物的单证，并转移标的物所有权的义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferOwnership"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c599-docs">
      <lrml:Comment>出卖人应当按照约定或者交易习惯向买受人交付提取标的物单证以外的有关单证和资料
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c599-docs", "articles": ["599"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4882", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第609条写成“已交付且未交付单证资料时风险仍由买受人承担”，与基础规则 c604-after 重复，只用来表达“未交单证不构成例外”；风险用 riskOnBuyer(K)，以合同为参数，与基础规则一致\n  · 起草者提示：“不动产以登记、动产以交付转移所有权”只写进 nl，未形式化\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c599-docs">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c599-docs-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出卖人应当按照约定或者交易习惯向买受人交付提取标的物单证以外的有关单证和资料</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deliverOtherDocumentsAndMaterials"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c609-risk">
      <lrml:Comment>出卖人按照约定未交付有关标的物的单证和资料的，不影响标的物毁损、灭失风险的转移（标的物已交付的，风险仍转移给买受人）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c609-risk", "articles": ["609"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4882", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第609条写成“已交付且未交付单证资料时风险仍由买受人承担”，与基础规则 c604-after 重复，只用来表达“未交单证不构成例外”；风险用 riskOnBuyer(K)，以合同为参数，与基础规则一致\n  · 起草者提示：“不动产以登记、动产以交付转移所有权”只写进 nl，未形式化\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c609-risk">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherDocumentsNotDeliveredAsAgreed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c597-nopower">
      <lrml:Comment>因出卖人未取得处分权致使标的物所有权不能转移的，买受人可以解除合同并请求出卖人承担违约责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c597-nopower", "articles": ["597"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4882", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第609条写成“已交付且未交付单证资料时风险仍由买受人承担”，与基础规则 c604-after 重复，只用来表达“未交单证不构成例外”；风险用 riskOnBuyer(K)，以合同为参数，与基础规则一致\n  · 起草者提示：“不动产以登记、动产以交付转移所有权”只写进 nl，未形式化\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c597-nopower">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownershipCannotTransfer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminationRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <lrml:Right key="c597-nopower-h1">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimBreachLiabilityFromSeller"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c597-restricted">
      <lrml:Comment>法律、行政法规禁止或者限制转让的标的物，依照其规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c597-restricted", "articles": ["597"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4882", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第609条写成“已交付且未交付单证资料时风险仍由买受人承担”，与基础规则 c604-after 重复，只用来表达“未交单证不构成例外”；风险用 riskOnBuyer(K)，以合同为参数，与基础规则一致\n  · 起草者提示：“不动产以登记、动产以交付转移所有权”只写进 nl，未形式化\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c597-restricted">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:prohibitedOrRestrictedTransfer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:governedBySpecialProvisions"/>
