    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c637-agreed">
      <lrml:Comment>试用买卖的当事人可以约定标的物的试用期限
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c637-agreed", "articles": ["637"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:637", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“依第510条仍不能确定”用了新谓词 trialPeriodIndeterminableAfterArt510，没有沿用 art:602 用的通用谓词 stillIndeterminableAfterArt510(K,term)，可考虑统一\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c637-agreed">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trialSale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sellerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:buyerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c637-agreed-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>试用买卖的当事人可以约定标的物的试用期限</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreeTrialPeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c637-seller">
      <lrml:Comment>对试用期限没有约定或者约定不明确，依据第510条仍不能确定的，由出卖人确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c637-seller", "articles": ["637"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:637", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“依第510条仍不能确定”用了新谓词 trialPeriodIndeterminableAfterArt510，没有沿用 art:602 用的通用谓词 stillIndeterminableAfterArt510(K,term)，可考虑统一\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c637-seller">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trialSale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sellerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearTrialPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trialPeriodIndeterminableAfterArt510"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
