                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determineTrialPeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c888-1">
      <lrml:Comment>保管合同是保管人保管寄存人交付的保管物，并返还该物的合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c888-1", "articles": ["888"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c888-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreementToKeepAndReturnDeliveredItem"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c888-2">
      <lrml:Comment>到保管人处购物、就餐、住宿等，将物品存放在指定场所的，视为保管；另有约定或交易习惯的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c888-2", "articles": ["888"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c888-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:customerActivityAtPremises"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:itemPlacedInDesignatedArea"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOrCustomOtherwiseOnDeemedStorage"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deemedStorage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c890">
      <lrml:Comment>保管合同自保管物交付时成立，当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c890", "articles": ["890"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c890">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositedProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedItemDelivered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnFormation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractFormed"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c891">
      <lrml:Comment>寄存人交付保管物的，保管人应当出具保管凭证，另有交易习惯的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c891", "articles": ["891"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c891">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositedProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedItemDelivered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tradeUsageOtherwiseOnStorageReceipt"/>
