            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c891-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>寄存人交付保管物的，保管人应当出具保管凭证，另有交易习惯的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:issueStorageReceipt"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c892-1">
      <lrml:Comment>保管人应当妥善保管保管物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c892-1", "articles": ["892"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c892-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c892-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保管人应当妥善保管保管物</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keepItemProperly"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c892-2">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人可以约定保管场所或方法；除紧急情况或为维护寄存人利益外，不得擅自改变
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c892-2", "articles": ["892"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c892-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedStoragePlaceOrMethod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:emergencyOrForDepositorInterest"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c892-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>当事人可以约定保管场所或方法；除紧急情况或为维护寄存人利益外，不得擅自改变</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:changeStoragePlaceOrMethodUnilaterally"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c893-1">
      <lrml:Comment>保管物有瑕疵或依其性质需要采取特殊保管措施的，寄存人应当告知保管人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c893-1", "articles": ["893"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c893-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedItemDefective"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedItemNeedsSpecialMeasures"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c893-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保管物有瑕疵或依其性质需要采取特殊保管措施的，寄存人应当告知保管人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:informDepositaryOfItemCondition"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c893-2">
      <lrml:Comment>寄存人未告知，致使保管物受损失的，保管人不承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c893-2", "articles": ["893"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c893-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:informedDepositaryOfItemCondition"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:itemLossFromNondisclosure"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryLiableForItemLoss"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c893-3">
      <lrml:Comment>保管人因此受损失的，寄存人应当赔偿；保管人知道或应当知道且未采取补救措施的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c893-3", "articles": ["893"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c893-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:informedDepositaryOfItemCondition"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryLossFromNondisclosure"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryKnewAndFailedToRemedy"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c893-3-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保管人因此受损失的，寄存人应当赔偿；保管人知道或应当知道且未采取补救措施的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c894-1">
      <lrml:Comment>保管人不得将保管物转交第三人保管，当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c894-1", "articles": ["894"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
