              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartyClaimsStoredItem"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preservationOrEnforcementOnItem"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c896-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>第三人对保管物主张权利的，除依法采取保全或执行措施外，保管人仍应向寄存人返还</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnItemToDepositor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c896-2">
      <lrml:Comment>第三人对保管人起诉或对保管物申请扣押的，保管人应当及时通知寄存人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c896-2", "articles": ["896"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c896-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartySuesDepositary"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thirdPartyAppliesToSeizeItem"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c896-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>第三人对保管人起诉或对保管物申请扣押的，保管人应当及时通知寄存人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyDepositorPromptly"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c897-1">
      <lrml:Comment>保管期内因保管不善造成保管物毁损、灭失的，保管人应当承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c897-1", "articles": ["897"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c897-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:itemDamagedOrLostByPoorKeeping"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryLiableForItemLoss"/>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c897-gratis">
      <lrml:Comment>无偿保管人证明自己没有故意或者重大过失的，不承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c897-gratis", "articles": ["897"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c897-gratis">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gratuitousStorage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNoIntentOrGrossNegligence"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryLiableForItemLoss"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c897-comp">
      <lrml:Comment>保管人承担赔偿责任的，向寄存人赔偿损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c897-comp", "articles": ["897"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c897-comp">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryLiableForItemLoss"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c897-comp-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保管人承担赔偿责任的，向寄存人赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c898-1">
      <lrml:Comment>寄存货币、有价证券或其他贵重物品的，应当声明，由保管人验收或封存
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c898-1", "articles": ["898"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c898-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositsMoneySecuritiesOrValuables"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c898-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>寄存货币、有价证券或其他贵重物品的，应当声明，由保管人验收或封存</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declareValuablesForInspectionOrSealing"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c898-2">
      <lrml:Comment>寄存人未声明的，该物品毁损、灭失后，保管人可以按照一般物品赔偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c898-2", "articles": ["898"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c898-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositsMoneySecuritiesOrValuables"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:declaredValuables"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedItemLoss"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c898-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>寄存人未声明的，该物品毁损、灭失后，保管人可以按照一般物品赔偿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:compensateAsOrdinaryItem"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c899-1">
      <lrml:Comment>寄存人可以随时领取保管物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c899-1", "articles": ["899"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c899-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c899-1-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:collectStoredItemAnyTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c899-2">
      <lrml:Comment>对保管期限没有约定或者约定不明确的，保管人可以随时请求寄存人领取
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c899-2", "articles": ["899"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c899-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositaryOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearStoragePeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c899-2-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestCollectionAnyTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c899-3">
      <lrml:Comment>约定保管期限的，保管人无特别事由，不得请求寄存人提前领取
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c899-3", "articles": ["899"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5674", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第893条“未告知致保管物受损，保管人不赔”和第897条“无偿保管人证明无故意或重大过失即免责”，都写成 -depositaryLiableForItemLoss，并声明优先于 c897-1\n  · 起草者提示：第892条第2款“当事人可以约定保管场所或方法”的许可没有单独成规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
