        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c970-2ag5870-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointlyExecutePartnershipAffairs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c970-entg5870">
      <lrml:Comment>按照约定或全体合伙人的决定，可以委托一个或数个合伙人执行合伙事务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c970-entg5870", "articles": ["970"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c970-entg5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedEntrustExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allPartnersDecideEntrustExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustedPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c970-entg5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>按照约定或全体合伙人的决定，可以委托一个或数个合伙人执行合伙事务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:executesPartnershipAffairs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c970-2cg5870">
      <lrml:Comment>其他合伙人不再执行合伙事务，但是有权监督执行情况
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c970-2cg5870", "articles": ["970"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c970-2cg5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustedPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:executesPartnershipAffairs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <lrml:Right key="c970-2cg5870-h1">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:superviseExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c970-3ag5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙人分别执行合伙事务的，执行事务合伙人可以对其他合伙人执行的事务提出异议
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c970-3ag5870", "articles": ["970"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c970-3ag5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separatelyExecutePartnershipAffairs"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:executesPartnershipAffairs"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c970-3ag5870-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:raiseObjectionToOtherPartnersExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c970-3bg5870">
      <lrml:Comment>提出异议后，其他合伙人应当暂停该项事务的执行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c970-3bg5870", "articles": ["970"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c970-3bg5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectionRaisedBy"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:objectedPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c970-3bg5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>提出异议后，其他合伙人应当暂停该项事务的执行</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suspendExecutionOfObjectedAffair"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c971-g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙人不得因执行合伙事务而请求支付报酬，合伙合同另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c971-g5870", "articles": ["971"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c971-g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:executesPartnershipAffairs"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedRemunerationForExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
