              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestRemunerationForExecution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c972-1g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>利润分配和亏损分担按照合伙合同的约定办理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c972-1g5870", "articles": ["972"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c972-1g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedProfitLossAllocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allocatedPerAgreement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c972-2g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>没有约定或约定不明确的，由合伙人协商决定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c972-2g5870", "articles": ["972"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c972-2g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearProfitLossAllocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiatedAllocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allocatedPerNegotiation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c972-3g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>协商不成的，按照实缴出资比例分配、分担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c972-3g5870", "articles": ["972"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c972-3g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearProfitLossAllocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:profitLossNegotiationFailed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidInContributionRatioDeterminable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allocatedPerPaidInRatio"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c972-4g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>无法确定出资比例的，由合伙人平均分配、分担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c972-4g5870", "articles": ["972"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c972-4g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearProfitLossAllocation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:profitLossNegotiationFailed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidInContributionRatioDeterminable"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allocatedEqually"/>
