            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c973-1g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙人对合伙债务承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c973-1g5870", "articles": ["973"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c973-1g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnershipDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c973-1g5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>合伙人对合伙债务承担连带责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearJointLiabilityForPartnershipDebt"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c973-2g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>清偿合伙债务超过自己应当承担份额的合伙人，有权向其他合伙人追偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c973-2g5870", "articles": ["973"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c973-2g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidPartnershipDebtExceedingShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c973-2g5870-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimRecourseAgainstOtherPartners"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c974-g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>除另有约定外，向合伙人以外的人转让全部或部分财产份额的，须经其他合伙人一致同意
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c974-g5870", "articles": ["974"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c974-g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersShareToOutsider"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnTransfer"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c974-g5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>除另有约定外，向合伙人以外的人转让全部或部分财产份额的，须经其他合伙人一致同意</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainConsentOfOtherPartners"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c975-g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙人的债权人不得代位行使合伙人依本章和合伙合同享有的权利
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c975-g5870", "articles": ["975"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c975-g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorOfPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c975-g5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>合伙人的债权人不得代位行使合伙人依本章和合伙合同享有的权利</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisePartnerRightsBySubrogation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c975-excg5870">
      <lrml:Comment>但合伙人享有的利益分配请求权除外，债权人可以代位行使
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c975-excg5870", "articles": ["975"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c975-excg5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorOfPartner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c975-excg5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>但合伙人享有的利益分配请求权除外，债权人可以代位行使</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subrogateProfitDistributionClaim"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c976-1g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>对合伙期限没有约定或约定不明确，依第510条仍不能确定的，视为不定期合伙
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c976-1g5870", "articles": ["976"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c976-1g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnershipContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearPartnershipTerm"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determinablePerArt510"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:indefinitePartnership"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c976-2g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙期限届满，合伙人继续执行事务且其他合伙人无异议的，原合同继续有效，但为不定期
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c976-2g5870", "articles": ["976"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c976-2g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnershipContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnershipTermExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnersContinueExecuting"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noObjectionByOtherPartners"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:indefinitePartnership"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c976-3g5870">
      <lrml:Comment>合伙人可以随时解除不定期合伙合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c976-3g5870", "articles": ["976"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c976-3g5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:indefinitePartnership"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c976-3g5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>合伙人可以随时解除不定期合伙合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminatePartnershipContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c976-ntcg5870">
      <lrml:Comment>解除不定期合伙合同应当在合理期限之前通知其他合伙人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c976-ntcg5870", "articles": ["976"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5870", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记中“一人不出资，其他合伙人不得因此拒绝出资”属学理内容，没有形式化，只写在 distinguish 里\n  · 起草者提示：第975条拆成禁止代位（FOR）和利益分配请求权可代位（PERM）两条，内容谓词不同，没有用优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c976-ntcg5870">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:indefinitePartnership"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partnerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesTermination"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c976-ntcg5870-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>解除不定期合伙合同应当在合理期限之前通知其他合伙人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notifyOtherPartnersInAdvance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c904">
      <lrml:Comment>仓储合同是保管人储存存货人交付的仓储物，存货人支付仓储费的合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c904", "articles": ["904"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c904">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:keeperStoresDeliveredGoodsForStorageFee"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehousingContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c906-1">
      <lrml:Comment>储存危险物品或易变质物品的，存货人应当说明该物品的性质，提供有关资料
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c906-1", "articles": ["906"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c906-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
