            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageFeeReduced"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c916-1">
      <lrml:Comment>储存期限届满不提取的，保管人可以催告其在合理期限内提取
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c916-1", "articles": ["916"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c916-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehousingContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storerOrReceiptHolder"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storageTermExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withdrewStoredGoods"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c916-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>储存期限届满不提取的，保管人可以催告其在合理期限内提取</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:urgeWithdrawalWithinReasonablePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c916-2">
      <lrml:Comment>催告后逾期不提取的，保管人可以提存仓储物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c916-2", "articles": ["916"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c916-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehousingContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storerOrReceiptHolder"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:urgedWithdrawal"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withdrewWithinReasonablePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c916-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>催告后逾期不提取的，保管人可以提存仓储物</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lodgeStoredGoodsInEscrow"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c917-1">
      <lrml:Comment>储存期内因保管不善造成仓储物毁损、灭失的，保管人应当承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c917-1", "articles": ["917"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c917-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehousingContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storedGoodsLostByPoorKeeping"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperLiable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c917-exc">
      <lrml:Comment>因仓储物本身的自然性质、包装不符合约定或超过有效储存期造成变质、损坏的，保管人不承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c917-exc", "articles": ["917"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c917-exc">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehousingContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageFromGoodsNature"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageFromNonconformingPackaging"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damageFromExceedingValidStoragePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperLiable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c917-comp">
      <lrml:Comment>保管人承担赔偿责任的，赔偿存货人的损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c917-comp", "articles": ["917"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5713", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：引入 storerOrReceiptHolder（存货人或仓单持有人）统一权利主体\n  · 起草者提示：第917条的赔偿对象写的是存货人；仓单已转让时赔偿权利人是谁，有讨论空间\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c917-comp">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:warehouseKeeperLiable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:storerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c917-comp-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保管人承担赔偿责任的，赔偿存货人的损失</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c510-suppg5812">
      <lrml:Comment>合同生效后，就质量、价款或者报酬、履行地点等没有约定或约定不明确的，可以协议补充
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c510-suppg5812", "articles": ["510"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c510-suppg5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termNotAgreedOrUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c510-suppg5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>合同生效后，就质量、价款或者报酬、履行地点等没有约定或约定不明确的，可以协议补充</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concludeSupplementaryAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c510-fillg5812">
      <lrml:Comment>不能达成补充协议的，按照合同相关条款或者交易习惯确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c510-fillg5812", "articles": ["510"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c510-fillg5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termNotAgreedOrUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noSupplementaryAgreementOn"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determinedByRelatedClausesOrUsage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c951-g5812">
      <lrml:Comment>行纪人以自己的名义为委托人从事贸易活动，委托人支付报酬的合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c951-g5812", "articles": ["951"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c951-g5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actsInOwnNameForPrincipal"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:principalPaysRemuneration"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c952-g5812">
      <lrml:Comment>行纪人处理委托事务支出的费用由行纪人负担，当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c952-g5812", "articles": ["952"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c952-g5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:expensesForCommissionedAffairs"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnCommissionExpenses"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c952-g5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>行纪人处理委托事务支出的费用由行纪人负担，当事人另有约定的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearCommissionExpenses"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c955-1ag5812">
      <lrml:Comment>低于指定价格卖出或高于指定价格买入的，应当经委托人同意
