            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionPrincipalOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:purchasedEntrustedGoodsPerAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c957-1ag5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>行纪人按照约定买入委托物，委托人应当及时受领</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acceptEntrustedGoodsInTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c957-1bg5812">
      <lrml:Comment>经催告，委托人无正当理由拒绝受领的，行纪人依法可以提存委托物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c957-1bg5812", "articles": ["957"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c957-1bg5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionPrincipalOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:purchasedEntrustedGoodsPerAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandedAcceptance"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refusesAcceptanceWithoutJustification"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c957-1bg5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>经催告，委托人无正当理由拒绝受领的，行纪人依法可以提存委托物</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositEntrustedGoods"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c957-2g5812">
      <lrml:Comment>委托物不能卖出或委托人撤回出卖，经催告委托人不取回或不处分的，行纪人依法可以提存
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c957-2g5812", "articles": ["957"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c957-2g5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionPrincipalOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodsCannotBeSold"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:principalWithdrawsSale"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandedRetrievalOrDisposal"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:principalFailsToRetrieveOrDispose"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c957-2g5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>委托物不能卖出或委托人撤回出卖，经催告委托人不取回或不处分的，行纪人依法可以提存</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:depositEntrustedGoods"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c959-payg5812">
      <lrml:Comment>行纪人完成或者部分完成委托事务的，委托人应当支付相应的报酬
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c959-payg5812", "articles": ["959"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c959-payg5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionPrincipalOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:completedCommissionWhollyOrPartly"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c959-payg5812-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>行纪人完成或者部分完成委托事务的，委托人应当支付相应的报酬</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCorrespondingRemuneration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c959-lieng5812">
      <lrml:Comment>委托人逾期不支付报酬的，行纪人对委托物享有留置权，当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c959-lieng5812", "articles": ["959"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5812", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第510条在本行只作为第955条第2款的引用条款，沿用 card:g4158 的写法另起 key\n  · 起草者提示：第959条留置权写作 lienRight(A,G,K)，“另有约定”用 ~lienExcludedByAgreement(G) 表达，沿用第449条以物为参数的用法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c959-lieng5812">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionAgentOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionPrincipalOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:remunerationOverdue"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commissionGoodsOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienExcludedByAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lienRight"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c979-g5961est">
      <lrml:Comment>管理人没有法定的或者约定的义务，为避免他人利益受损失而管理他人事务，构成无因管理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961est", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961est">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:managesAffairsFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noLegalOrAgreedDuty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:toAvoidLossOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c979-g5961exp">
      <lrml:Comment>管理人可以请求受益人偿还因管理事务而支出的必要费用
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961exp", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961exp">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:expensesIncurredFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorClaimsExcluded"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c979-g5961exp-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimReimbursementOfNecessaryExpenses"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c979-g5961comp">
      <lrml:Comment>管理人因管理事务受到损失的，可以请求受益人给予适当补偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961comp", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961comp">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suffersLossInManaging"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorClaimsExcluded"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c979-g5961comp-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAppropriateCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c979-g5961contrary">
      <lrml:Comment>管理事务不符合受益人真实意思的，管理人不享有第1款的权利；受益人真实意思违反法律或者违背公序良俗的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961contrary", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961contrary">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:managesAffairsFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contraryToBeneficiaryTrueIntention"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:beneficiaryIntentionViolatesLaw"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:beneficiaryTrueIntentionViolatesPublicOrder"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorClaimsExcluded"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c979-g5961nofee">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：无因管理人无报酬请求权（第979条只规定必要费用和适当补偿，学理）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961nofee", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961nofee">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorRemunerationEntitled"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c979-g5961debt">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：管理人为本人利益以自己名义负担的债务，有权要求本人直接向债权人清偿（学理，视为必要费用的延伸）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c979-g5961debt", "articles": ["979"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c979-g5961debt">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtIncurredInOwnNameForBeneficiary"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorClaimsExcluded"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c979-g5961debt-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestDirectPaymentToCreditor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c980-g5961benefit">
      <lrml:Comment>管理事务不属于第979条规定的情形，但受益人享有管理利益的，受益人应当在其获得的利益范围内承担偿还费用、补偿损失的义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c980-g5961benefit", "articles": ["980"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c980-g5961benefit">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:managesAffairsFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gestorClaimsExcluded"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:benefitsFromManagement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c980-g5961benefit-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>管理事务不属于第979条规定的情形，但受益人享有管理利益的，受益人应当在其获得的利益范围内承担偿还费用、补偿损失的义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reimburseAndCompensateWithinBenefitScope"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c981-g5961method">
      <lrml:Comment>管理人管理他人事务，应当采取有利于受益人的方法
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c981-g5961method", "articles": ["981"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5961", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记前后矛盾：一处说必要费用“一般以本人所受利益范围为限”，另一处说“即使受益人没有获益也要承担”。按第979条原文，真正无因管理的费用偿还不以受益人获益为要件，以获益范围为限的是第980条；已在 distinguish 中写明\n  · 起草者提示：“管理人无报酬请求权”“以自己名义负担的债务可请求本人直接清偿”两条写成学理规则\n  · 起草者提示：第980条“不属于前条规定的情形”只形式化为“违背受益人合法真实意思”这一种情形（谓词 gestorClaimsExcluded），可能比条文窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c981-g5961method">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negotiorumManagement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c981-g5961method-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>管理人管理他人事务，应当采取有利于受益人的方法</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
