    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c886">
      <lrml:Comment>受托人正常开展工作所需费用的负担没有约定或约定不明确的，由受托人负担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c886", "articles": ["886"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5605", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：本行挂载的第859条与 card:g5618 重复，沿用同一组谓词另写了 c859-pat/use/pre，可考虑去重\n  · 起草者提示：第860条中“其他各方”与转让方、放弃方不是同一人的条件没有形式化\n  · 起草者提示：第861条“在没有相同技术方案被授予专利权前”写成 -sameSolutionPatented(S)，时间性只是近似表达\n  · 起草者提示：第845条第1款（合同一般条款）属指引性条款，没有写规则\n  · 起草者提示：第885条“另有约定从约定”用 c885-agreed 加优先关系表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c886">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:consultingOrServiceTrustee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearWorkExpenses"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c886-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>受托人正常开展工作所需费用的负担没有约定或约定不明确的，由受托人负担</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearNormalWorkExpenses"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c470-modelg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人可以参照各类合同的示范文本订立合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c470-modelg3988", "articles": ["470"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c470-modelg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c470-modelg3988-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>当事人可以参照各类合同的示范文本订立合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concludeWithModelText"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c495-defg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人约定在将来一定期限内订立合同的认购书、订购书、预订书等，构成预约合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c495-defg3988", "articles": ["495"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c495-defg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreesToConcludeContractWithinFuturePeriod"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preliminaryContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c495-breachg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人一方不履行预约合同约定的订立合同义务的，对方可以请求其承担预约合同的违约责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c495-breachg3988", "articles": ["495"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c495-breachg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preliminaryContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsToConcludeContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c495-breachg3988-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimBreachLiability"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c496-defg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>格式条款是当事人为了重复使用而预先拟定，并在订立合同时未与对方协商的条款
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c496-defg3988", "articles": ["496"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c496-defg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preparedInAdvanceForRepeatedUse"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notNegotiatedAtConclusion"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:formatClause"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c496-fairg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>提供格式条款的一方应当遵循公平原则确定当事人之间的权利和义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c496-fairg3988", "articles": ["496"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c496-fairg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:formatClause"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:providerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c496-fairg3988-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>提供格式条款的一方应当遵循公平原则确定当事人之间的权利和义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determineRightsAndObligationsPerFairnessPrinciple"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c496-noticeg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>提供方应以合理方式提示对方注意免除或者减轻其责任等与对方有重大利害关系的条款，并按对方要求予以说明
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c496-noticeg3988", "articles": ["496"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c496-noticeg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:formatClause"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:providerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termExemptsOrReducesLiabilityOrMajorInterest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c496-noticeg3988-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>提供方应以合理方式提示对方注意免除或者减轻其责任等与对方有重大利害关系的条款，并按对方要求予以说明</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:promptNoticeAndExplain"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c496-excludeg3988">
      <lrml:Comment>提供方未履行提示或者说明义务，致使对方没有注意或者理解与其有重大利害关系的条款的，对方可以主张该条款不成为合同的内容
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c496-excludeg3988", "articles": ["496"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3988", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c496-excludeg3988">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:formatClause"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:providerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termExemptsOrReducesLiabilityOrMajorInterest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failedToPromptOrExplain"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyDidNotNoticeOrUnderstand"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c496-excludeg3988-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:assertTermNotPartOfContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c578-anticip">
      <lrml:Comment>履行期届满前明确表示或者以自己的行为表明不履行合同义务（预期违约），属于不履行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c578-anticip", "articles": ["578"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4732", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：免责事由（不可抗力、有效的约定免责条款）写成了学理规则 c577-exempt，因为第590条不在本行挂载范围内\n  · 起草者提示：预期违约直接推出 nonPerformance（不履行），从而并入第577条的违约构成；第578条的提前请求权另外用了新谓词 claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue，因为已有的 requestBreachLiability 释义限定为“请求出卖人”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c578-anticip">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:anticipatoryRepudiation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonPerformance"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c577-elements">
      <lrml:Comment>有效合同的当事人一方不履行合同义务或者履行合同义务不符合约定，构成违约
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c577-elements", "articles": ["577"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4732", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：免责事由（不可抗力、有效的约定免责条款）写成了学理规则 c577-exempt，因为第590条不在本行挂载范围内\n  · 起草者提示：预期违约直接推出 nonPerformance（不履行），从而并入第577条的违约构成；第578条的提前请求权另外用了新谓词 claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue，因为已有的 requestBreachLiability 释义限定为“请求出卖人”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c577-elements">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:valid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonConformingPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachingParty"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c577-liab">
      <lrml:Comment>违约方应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任；存在免责事由的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c577-liab", "articles": ["577"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4732", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：免责事由（不可抗力、有效的约定免责条款）写成了学理规则 c577-exempt，因为第590条不在本行挂载范围内\n  · 起草者提示：预期违约直接推出 nonPerformance（不履行），从而并入第577条的违约构成；第578条的提前请求权另外用了新谓词 claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue，因为已有的 requestBreachLiability 释义限定为“请求出卖人”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c577-liab">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachingParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonBreachingParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachExemptionGround"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c577-liab-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>违约方应当承担继续履行、采取补救措施或者赔偿损失等违约责任；存在免责事由的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableForBreach"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c577-exempt">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：不存在免责事由是违约责任构成要件之一；免责事由包括不可抗力（第590条）及有效的约定免责条款，本行未挂载第590条，按学理写入
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c577-exempt", "articles": ["577"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4732", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：免责事由（不可抗力、有效的约定免责条款）写成了学理规则 c577-exempt，因为第590条不在本行挂载范围内\n  · 起草者提示：预期违约直接推出 nonPerformance（不履行），从而并入第577条的违约构成；第578条的提前请求权另外用了新谓词 claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue，因为已有的 requestBreachLiability 释义限定为“请求出卖人”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c577-exempt">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachingParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forceMajeureExemption"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedExemptionGround"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:breachExemptionGround"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c578-early">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人一方预期违约的，对方可以在履行期限届满前请求其承担违约责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c578-early", "articles": ["578"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4732", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：免责事由（不可抗力、有效的约定免责条款）写成了学理规则 c577-exempt，因为第590条不在本行挂载范围内\n  · 起草者提示：预期违约直接推出 nonPerformance（不履行），从而并入第577条的违约构成；第578条的提前请求权另外用了新谓词 claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue，因为已有的 requestBreachLiability 释义限定为“请求出卖人”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c578-early">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:anticipatoryRepudiation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:nonBreachingParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performancePeriodNotExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c578-early-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>当事人一方预期违约的，对方可以在履行期限届满前请求其承担违约责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimBreachLiabilityBeforeDue"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c770-defg5444">
      <lrml:Comment>承揽合同是承揽人按照定作人的要求完成工作，交付工作成果，定作人支付报酬的合同；包括加工、定作、修理、复制、测试、检验等工作
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c770-defg5444", "articles": ["770"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5444", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第771条只是列举合同一般条款的提示性规定，只写进 nl，没有规则\n  · 起草者提示：第783条“另有约定的除外”用了新谓词 otherwiseAgreedOnWorkResultLien(K)，没有沿用 lienExcludedByAgreement/1，因为后者的参数含义不明确\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c770-defg5444">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:completesWorkPerRequirement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:resultDeliveredForRemuneration"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:workContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c772-personalg5444">
      <lrml:Comment>承揽人应当以自己的设备、技术和劳力，完成主要工作，但是当事人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c772-personalg5444", "articles": ["772"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5444", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第771条只是列举合同一般条款的提示性规定，只写进 nl，没有规则\n  · 起草者提示：第783条“另有约定的除外”用了新谓词 otherwiseAgreedOnWorkResultLien(K)，没有沿用 lienExcludedByAgreement/1，因为后者的参数含义不明确\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c772-personalg5444">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:workContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOfWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnMainWork"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c772-personalg5444-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承揽人应当以自己的设备、技术和劳力，完成主要工作，但是当事人另有约定的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:completeMainWorkPersonally"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c772-respg5444">
      <lrml:Comment>承揽人将其承揽的主要工作交由第三人完成的，应当就该第三人完成的工作成果向定作人负责
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c772-respg5444", "articles": ["772"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5444", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第771条只是列举合同一般条款的提示性规定，只写进 nl，没有规则\n  · 起草者提示：第783条“另有约定的除外”用了新谓词 otherwiseAgreedOnWorkResultLien(K)，没有沿用 lienExcludedByAgreement/1，因为后者的参数含义不明确\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c772-respg5444">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOfWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:clientOfWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustsMainWorkToThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c772-respg5444-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承揽人将其承揽的主要工作交由第三人完成的，应当就该第三人完成的工作成果向定作人负责</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:beResponsibleForThirdPartyWorkResult"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c772-termg5444">
      <lrml:Comment>未经定作人同意将主要工作交由第三人完成的，定作人也可以解除合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c772-termg5444", "articles": ["772"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5444", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第771条只是列举合同一般条款的提示性规定，只写进 nl，没有规则\n  · 起草者提示：第783条“另有约定的除外”用了新谓词 otherwiseAgreedOnWorkResultLien(K)，没有沿用 lienExcludedByAgreement/1，因为后者的参数含义不明确\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c772-termg5444">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOfWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:clientOfWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustsMainWorkToThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
