    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c693-1">
      <lrml:Comment>一般保证的债权人未在保证期间对债务人提起诉讼或者申请仲裁的，保证人不再承担保证责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c693-1", "articles": ["693"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:693", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“保证期间已届满”用新谓词 guaranteePeriodExpired，未与第692条的起算、期间接上计算关系\n  · 起草者提示：c693-spc27 把赋强公证后申请执行视为已在保证期间内起诉，比担保解释第27条原文推得更远\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c693-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:generalGuarantee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteePeriodExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suedDebtorWithinGuaranteePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityLiabilityOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c693-2">
      <lrml:Comment>连带责任保证的债权人未在保证期间请求保证人承担保证责任的，保证人不再承担保证责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c693-2", "articles": ["693"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:693", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“保证期间已届满”用新谓词 guaranteePeriodExpired，未与第692条的起算、期间接上计算关系\n  · 起草者提示：c693-spc27 把赋强公证后申请执行视为已在保证期间内起诉，比担保解释第27条原文推得更远\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c693-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiabilityGuarantee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteePeriodExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestedSuretyWithinPeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityLiabilityOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c693-spc27">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉有关担保制度的解释》第27条：一般保证的债权人取得对债务人赋予强制执行效力的公证债权文书后，在保证期间内向人民法院申请强制执行，保证人以未在保证期间内起诉或仲裁为由主张不承担保证责任的，不予支持
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c693-spc27", "articles": ["693"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:693", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“保证期间已届满”用新谓词 guaranteePeriodExpired，未与第692条的起算、期间接上计算关系\n  · 起草者提示：c693-spc27 把赋强公证后申请执行视为已在保证期间内起诉，比担保解释第27条原文推得更远\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c693-spc27">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:generalGuarantee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notarizedEnforcementAppliedWithinPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suedDebtorWithinGuaranteePeriod"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c693-spc31a">
      <lrml:Comment>担保制度解释第31条第1款：一般保证的债权人在保证期间内对债务人起诉或申请仲裁后又撤回，在保证期间届满前未再行起诉或申请仲裁，保证人主张不再承担保证责任的，应予支持
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c693-spc31a", "articles": ["693"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:693", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“保证期间已届满”用新谓词 guaranteePeriodExpired，未与第692条的起算、期间接上计算关系\n  · 起草者提示：c693-spc27 把赋强公证后申请执行视为已在保证期间内起诉，比担保解释第27条原文推得更远\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c693-spc31a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:generalGuarantee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteePeriodExpired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suitAgainstDebtorWithdrawnNotRefiled"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securityLiabilityOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c693-spc31b">
      <lrml:Comment>担保制度解释第31条第2款：连带责任保证的债权人在保证期间内对保证人起诉或申请仲裁后又撤回，起诉状副本或者仲裁申请书副本已经送达保证人的，认定已在保证期间内向保证人行使了权利
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c693-spc31b", "articles": ["693"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:693", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“保证期间已届满”用新谓词 guaranteePeriodExpired，未与第692条的起算、期间接上计算关系\n  · 起草者提示：c693-spc27 把赋强公证后申请执行视为已在保证期间内起诉，比担保解释第27条原文推得更远\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c693-spc31b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:jointLiabilityGuarantee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suitAgainstGuarantorWithdrawnAfterService"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestedSuretyWithinPeriod"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c689">
      <lrml:Comment>保证人可以要求债务人提供反担保
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c689", "articles": ["689"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:689", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：只写了一条 PERM（可以要求反担保），反担保适用的法律引到第387条第2款\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c689">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suretyFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c689-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保证人可以要求债务人提供反担保</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestCounterSecurity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c682-acc">
      <lrml:Comment>保证合同是主债权债务合同的从合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c682-acc", "articles": ["682"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5182", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c695-reduce/c695-increase：保证人书面同意变更的情形没有正面规则；c682-2 采第388条第2款写法，需与物权编 c388-7 统一\n  · 起草者提示：c701-spc35（FOR）与 c701-1（PERM）的 content 不同，推理上不会自动压过 c701-1\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c682-acc">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mainContractOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accessoryContractOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c682-guarantor">
      <lrml:Comment>保证合同中的保证人即该担保合同的担保人（衔接第682条第2款与第388条的谓词）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c682-guarantor", "articles": ["682"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5182", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c695-reduce/c695-increase：保证人书面同意变更的情形没有正面规则；c682-2 采第388条第2款写法，需与物权编 c388-7 统一\n  · 起草者提示：c701-spc35（FOR）与 c701-1（PERM）的 content 不同，推理上不会自动压过 c701-1\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c682-guarantor">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContractFor"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guarantorOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c682-void">
      <lrml:Comment>主债权债务合同无效的，保证合同无效，但是法律另有规定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c682-void", "articles": ["682"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5182", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c695-reduce/c695-increase：保证人书面同意变更的情形没有正面规则；c682-2 采第388条第2款写法，需与物权编 c388-7 统一\n  · 起草者提示：c701-spc35（FOR）与 c701-1（PERM）的 content 不同，推理上不会自动压过 c701-1\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c682-void">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accessoryContractOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnAccessoryInvalidity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c682-2">
      <lrml:Comment>保证合同被确认无效后，债务人、保证人、债权人有过错的，应当根据其过错各自承担相应的民事责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c682-2", "articles": ["682"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5182", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c695-reduce/c695-increase：保证人书面同意变更的情形没有正面规则；c682-2 采第388条第2款写法，需与物权编 c388-7 统一\n  · 起草者提示：c701-spc35（FOR）与 c701-1（PERM）的 content 不同，推理上不会自动压过 c701-1\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c682-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confirmedVoid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mainContractOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtorIn"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorIn"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guarantorOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c682-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>保证合同被确认无效后，债务人、保证人、债权人有过错的，应当根据其过错各自承担相应的民事责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearLiabilityAccordingToFault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c682-spc2">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉有关担保制度的解释》第2条：约定担保合同效力独立于主合同，或约定担保人对主合同无效的法律后果承担担保责任的，该有关担保独立性的约定无效；主合同有效的不影响担保合同效力，主合同无效的担保合同无效（法律另有规定除外）；金融机构开立的独立保函适用独立保函司法解释
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c682-spc2", "articles": ["682"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5182", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c695-reduce/c695-increase：保证人书面同意变更的情形没有正面规则；c682-2 采第388条第2款写法，需与物权编 c388-7 统一\n  · 起草者提示：c701-spc35（FOR）与 c701-1（PERM）的 content 不同，推理上不会自动压过 c701-1\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c682-spc2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:guaranteeContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedIndependenceFromMainContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:independentGuaranteeByFinancialInstitution"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:independenceClauseVoid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c682-spc17a">
      <lrml:Comment>担保制度解释第17条第1款第1项：主合同有效而第三人提供的担保合同无效，债权人与担保人均有过错的，担保人的赔偿责任不应超过债务人不能清偿部分的二分之一
