      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c815-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:realNamePassengerContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ticketLost"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Right key="c815-2-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestTicketLossReportAndReissue"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c815-2-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>实名制客运旅客丢失客票可请求挂失补办，承运人不得再次收取票款和其他不合理费用</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:chargeFareAgainOrUnreasonableFee"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c819-1">
      <lrml:Comment>承运人应当严格履行安全运输义务，及时告知安全注意事项
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c819-1", "articles": ["819"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c819-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c819-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承运人应当严格履行安全运输义务，及时告知安全注意事项</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performSafeCarriageDuty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c819-1-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承运人应当严格履行安全运输义务，及时告知安全注意事项</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:informSafetyMatters"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c819-2">
      <lrml:Comment>旅客对承运人为安全运输所作的合理安排应当积极协助和配合
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c819-2", "articles": ["819"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c819-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reasonableSafetyArrangement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c819-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>旅客对承运人为安全运输所作的合理安排应当积极协助和配合</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cooperateWithSafetyArrangement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c820-1">
      <lrml:Comment>承运人应当按照有效客票记载的时间、班次和座位号运输旅客
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c820-1", "articles": ["820"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c820-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c820-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承运人应当按照有效客票记载的时间、班次和座位号运输旅客</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carryAsTicketed"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c820-dis">
      <lrml:Comment>迟延运输或有其他不能正常运输情形
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c820-dis", "articles": ["820"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c820-dis">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delayedCarriage"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherAbnormalCarriage"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carriageDisrupted"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c820-2">
      <lrml:Comment>应当及时告知和提醒旅客，采取必要的安置措施
