      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c824-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carryOnItemsDamagedOrLostInTransit"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c824-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>运输过程中旅客随身携带物品毁损、灭失，承运人有过错的应当赔偿（过错责任）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payCompensation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c824-2">
      <lrml:Comment>旅客托运的行李毁损、灭失的，适用货物运输的有关规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c824-2", "articles": ["824"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c824-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:passengerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:checkedLuggageDamagedOrLost"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:governedByCargoTransportRules"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c826">
      <lrml:Comment>需要办理审批、检验等手续的，托运人应当将办理完手续的文件提交承运人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c826", "articles": ["826"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c826">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shipperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:carrierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cargoRequiresApprovalOrInspection"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c826-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>需要办理审批、检验等手续的，托运人应当将办理完手续的文件提交承运人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:submitClearanceDocuments"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c827-1">
      <lrml:Comment>托运人应当按照约定的方式包装货物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c827-1", "articles": ["827"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5543", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第838条用 carrierOf(O,K) 作为多式联运经营人的构成性结论，会让多式联运经营人适用所有以 carrierOf 为条件的客运、货运规则，范围可能偏宽\n  · 起草者提示：第839条“区段约定不影响经营人全程义务”写成不以有无约定为条件、直接课以全程责任，没有单独写排除规则\n  · 起草者提示：第824条第1款的承运人过错沿用通用谓词 fault(C,K)\n  · 起草者提示：第810条强制缔约的相对人没有区分旅客和托运人\n  · 起草者提示：第832条免责事由写成“承运人证明原因 + 三类原因择一”，举证责任只用 carrierProvesCauseOfGoodsLoss 表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c827-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shipperOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedPackagingMethod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c827-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>托运人应当按照约定的方式包装货物</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:packageGoodsAsAgreed"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c827-619">
      <lrml:Comment>对包装方式没有约定或者约定不明确的，适用第619条
