    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c667-g5149return">
      <lrml:Comment>借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c667-g5149return", "articles": ["667"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第674条中利息支付期限无约定或约定不明时的补充规则、第668条书面形式，已由 card:g5151 和 card:g5155 形式化，本行没有重复\n  · 起草者提示：自然人借款利息约定不明的规则同时推出 -interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate，并声明优先于一般的“按交易习惯、市场利率确定”规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c667-g5149return">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:loanContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:borrowerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lenderOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:loanProvided"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c667-g5149return-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>借款合同是借款人向贷款人借款，到期返还借款并支付利息的合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:returnLoanAtMaturity"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c674-g5149pay">
      <lrml:Comment>借款人应当按照约定的期限支付利息（视为没有利息的除外）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c674-g5149pay", "articles": ["667", "674"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第674条中利息支付期限无约定或约定不明时的补充规则、第668条书面形式，已由 card:g5151 和 card:g5155 形式化，本行没有重复\n  · 起草者提示：自然人借款利息约定不明的规则同时推出 -interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate，并声明优先于一般的“按交易习惯、市场利率确定”规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
