                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:setInterestRateViolatingStateRules"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c680-g5149none">
      <lrml:Comment>借款合同对支付利息没有约定的，视为没有利息
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c680-g5149none", "articles": ["680"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第674条中利息支付期限无约定或约定不明时的补充规则、第668条书面形式，已由 card:g5151 和 card:g5155 形式化，本行没有重复\n  · 起草者提示：自然人借款利息约定不明的规则同时推出 -interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate，并声明优先于一般的“按交易习惯、市场利率确定”规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c680-g5149none">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:loanContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreementOnInterest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestFree"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c680-g5149unclear">
      <lrml:Comment>对支付利息约定不明确，不能达成补充协议的，按照当地或者当事人的交易方式、交易习惯、市场利率等因素确定利息
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c680-g5149unclear", "articles": ["680"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第674条中利息支付期限无约定或约定不明时的补充规则、第668条书面形式，已由 card:g5151 和 card:g5155 形式化，本行没有重复\n  · 起草者提示：自然人借款利息约定不明的规则同时推出 -interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate，并声明优先于一般的“按交易习惯、市场利率确定”规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c680-g5149unclear">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:loanContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestAgreementUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noSupplementaryAgreementReached"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c680-g5149natural">
      <lrml:Comment>自然人之间借款对利息约定不明确的，视为没有利息
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c680-g5149natural", "articles": ["680"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第674条中利息支付期限无约定或约定不明时的补充规则、第668条书面形式，已由 card:g5151 和 card:g5155 形式化，本行没有重复\n  · 起草者提示：自然人借款利息约定不明的规则同时推出 -interestDeterminedByUsageOrMarketRate，并声明优先于一般的“按交易习惯、市场利率确定”规则\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c680-g5149natural">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:loanContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPersonLoan"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestAgreementUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noSupplementaryAgreementReached"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
