    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c796-1">
      <lrml:Comment>建设工程实行监理的，发包人应当与监理人采用书面形式订立委托监理合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c796-1", "articles": ["796"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:796", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c796-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supervisionImplemented"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supervisorFor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c796-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>建设工程实行监理的，发包人应当与监理人采用书面形式订立委托监理合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concludeWrittenSupervisionContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c796-2">
      <lrml:Comment>发包人与监理人的权利和义务以及法律责任，应当依照本编委托合同以及其他有关法律、行政法规的规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c796-2", "articles": ["796"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:796", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c796-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supervisionContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:governedByEntrustmentRulesAndRelatedLaws"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c797">
      <lrml:Comment>发包人在不妨碍承包人正常作业的情况下，可以随时对作业进度、质量进行检查
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c797", "articles": ["797"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:797", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“在不妨碍正常作业的情况下”写成除外条件 ~inspectionHindersNormalWork，也可改为正面要件\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c797">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectionHindersNormalWork"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c797-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>发包人在不妨碍承包人正常作业的情况下，可以随时对作业进度、质量进行检查</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectProgressAndQuality"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c790-spc1">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于审理建设工程施工合同纠纷案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》（法释〔2020〕25号）第1条第1款第3项：建设工程必须进行招标而未招标或者中标无效的，依民法典第153条第1款认定施工合同无效（已据最高法官网逐字核对）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c790-spc1", "articles": ["790"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:790", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“三公”原则未写规则，只用司法解释规则补了“必须招标而未招标或中标无效，合同无效”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c790-spc1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionWorkContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mandatoryTenderNotConducted"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bidWinningVoid"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:void"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c800">
      <lrml:Comment>勘察、设计的质量不符合要求或者未按照期限提交勘察、设计文件拖延工期，造成发包人损失的，勘察人、设计人应当继续完善勘察、设计，减收或者免收勘察、设计费并赔偿损失
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c800", "articles": ["800"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:800", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：勘察人、设计人未单独建谓词，直接用 contractorOf(S,K)\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c800">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surveyContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surveyDesignQualityNonconforming"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surveyDesignDocumentsLateDelayingSchedule"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lossCausedToEmployer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c800-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>勘察、设计的质量不符合要求或者未按照期限提交勘察、设计文件拖延工期，造成发包人损失的，勘察人、设计人应当继续完善勘察、设计，减收或者免收勘察、设计费并赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:continueImprovingSurveyDesign"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c800-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>勘察、设计的质量不符合要求或者未按照期限提交勘察、设计文件拖延工期，造成发包人损失的，勘察人、设计人应当继续完善勘察、设计，减收或者免收勘察、设计费并赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reduceOrWaiveSurveyDesignFee"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c800-h2">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>勘察、设计的质量不符合要求或者未按照期限提交勘察、设计文件拖延工期，造成发包人损失的，勘察人、设计人应当继续完善勘察、设计，减收或者免收勘察、设计费并赔偿损失</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:compensateLoss"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c791-1a">
      <lrml:Comment>发包人可以与总承包人订立建设工程合同，也可以分别与勘察人、设计人、施工人订立勘察、设计、施工承包合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c791-1a", "articles": ["791"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5499", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c793-2b 把“承包人无权请求参照约定折价补偿”写成 FOR；c793-2a-doc（学理）补了“修复后验收合格仍可请求折价补偿”，条文未明写\n  · 起草者提示：c793-3 限于“施工合同无效且验收不合格”语境；c791-2b 的连带责任只写了经发包人同意分包的情形\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c791-1a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOfProject"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c791-1a-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>发包人可以与总承包人订立建设工程合同，也可以分别与勘察人、设计人、施工人订立勘察、设计、施工承包合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:awardToGeneralOrSeparateContractors"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c791-1b">
      <lrml:Comment>发包人不得将应当由一个承包人完成的建设工程支解成若干部分发包给数个承包人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c791-1b", "articles": ["791"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5499", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c793-2b 把“承包人无权请求参照约定折价补偿”写成 FOR；c793-2a-doc（学理）补了“修复后验收合格仍可请求折价补偿”，条文未明写\n  · 起草者提示：c793-3 限于“施工合同无效且验收不合格”语境；c791-2b 的连带责任只写了经发包人同意分包的情形\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c791-1b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOfProject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:projectForSingleContractor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c791-1b-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>发包人不得将应当由一个承包人完成的建设工程支解成若干部分发包给数个承包人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:splitProjectToMultipleContractors"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c791-2a">
      <lrml:Comment>总承包人或者勘察、设计、施工承包人经发包人同意，可以将自己承包的部分工作交由第三人完成
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c791-2a", "articles": ["791"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5499", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c793-2b 把“承包人无权请求参照约定折价补偿”写成 FOR；c793-2a-doc（学理）补了“修复后验收合格仍可请求折价补偿”，条文未明写\n  · 起草者提示：c793-3 限于“施工合同无效且验收不合格”语境；c791-2b 的连带责任只写了经发包人同意分包的情形\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c791-2a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
