              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partOfContractedWork"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerConsentedSubcontract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c791-2a-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>总承包人或者勘察、设计、施工承包人经发包人同意，可以将自己承包的部分工作交由第三人完成</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subcontractToThirdParty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c791-2b">
      <lrml:Comment>第三人就其完成的工作成果与总承包人或者勘察、设计、施工承包人向发包人承担连带责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c791-2b", "articles": ["791"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5499", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c793-2b 把“承包人无权请求参照约定折价补偿”写成 FOR；c793-2a-doc（学理）补了“修复后验收合格仍可请求折价补偿”，条文未明写\n  · 起草者提示：c793-3 限于“施工合同无效且验收不合格”语境；c791-2b 的连带责任只写了经发包人同意分包的情形\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
