            </lrml:Permission>
            <lrml:Permission key="c807-1-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>发包人逾期不支付的，除根据建设工程的性质不宜折价、拍卖外，承包人可以与发包人协议将该工程折价，也可以请求人民法院将该工程依法拍卖</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestCourtAuctionOfProject"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c807-2">
      <lrml:Comment>建设工程的价款就该工程折价或者拍卖的价款优先受偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c807-2", "articles": ["807"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5525", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记两处过时：优先受偿权期限“竣工之日起六个月”已按施工合同解释（一）第41条改为“合理期限、最长十八个月、自应付款之日起算”；装饰装修但书已按第37条改为“具备折价或者拍卖条件”\n  · 起草者提示：三条反面推论待复核：c807-qual（质量不合格不享有优先受偿权，学理）、c807-spc41（超期丧失）、c807-spc42（未损害工人利益的放弃约定可对抗承包人）；《商品房消费者权利保护批复》未逐字核对，只写在区分栏\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c807-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:projectOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerStillUnpaidAfterDemand"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unsuitableForDiscountOrAuctionByNature"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionPricePriority"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c807-spc35">
      <lrml:Comment>法释〔2020〕25号第35条：与发包人订立建设工程施工合同的承包人，依据民法典第807条请求其承建工程的价款就工程折价或者拍卖的价款优先受偿的，人民法院应予支持（已据最高法官网逐字核对）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c807-spc35", "articles": ["807"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5525", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记两处过时：优先受偿权期限“竣工之日起六个月”已按施工合同解释（一）第41条改为“合理期限、最长十八个月、自应付款之日起算”；装饰装修但书已按第37条改为“具备折价或者拍卖条件”\n  · 起草者提示：三条反面推论待复核：c807-qual（质量不合格不享有优先受偿权，学理）、c807-spc41（超期丧失）、c807-spc42（未损害工人利益的放弃约定可对抗承包人）；《商品房消费者权利保护批复》未逐字核对，只写在区分栏\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c807-spc35">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionWorkContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:projectOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractedDirectlyWithEmployer"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorityEligibleContractor"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c807-spc36">
      <lrml:Comment>法释〔2020〕25号第36条：承包人根据民法典第807条享有的建设工程价款优先受偿权优于抵押权和其他债权（已逐字核对）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c807-spc36", "articles": ["807"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5525", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：笔记两处过时：优先受偿权期限“竣工之日起六个月”已按施工合同解释（一）第41条改为“合理期限、最长十八个月、自应付款之日起算”；装饰装修但书已按第37条改为“具备折价或者拍卖条件”\n  · 起草者提示：三条反面推论待复核：c807-qual（质量不合格不享有优先受偿权，学理）、c807-spc41（超期丧失）、c807-spc42（未损害工人利益的放弃约定可对抗承包人）；《商品房消费者权利保护批复》未逐字核对，只写在区分栏\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c807-spc36">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constructionPricePriority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:competingMortgageOrOtherClaim"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ranksBefore"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c807-spc37">
      <lrml:Comment>法释〔2020〕25号第37条：装饰装修工程具备折价或者拍卖条件，装饰装修工程的承包人请求工程价款就该装饰装修工程折价或者拍卖的价款优先受偿的，人民法院应予支持（已逐字核对）
