              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminateContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c717">
      <lrml:Comment>经同意转租，转租期限超过承租人剩余租赁期限的，超过部分的约定对出租人不具有法律约束力，但出租人与承租人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c717", "articles": ["717"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5260", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第728条赔偿规则沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属），原文没有，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：第704条为提示性条款未写规则；一房数租（房屋租赁解释第5条）不属挂载条文，未写\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c717">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordConsentedToSublease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subleaseContractOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Sub</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subleaseUnder"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subleaseTermExceedsRemainingTerm"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnExcessSubleaseTerm"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessSubleaseTermNotBindingOnLessor"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c718">
      <lrml:Comment>出租人知道或者应当知道承租人转租，但是在六个月内未提出异议的，视为出租人同意转租
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c718", "articles": ["718"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5260", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第728条赔偿规则沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属），原文没有，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：第704条为提示性条款未写规则；一房数租（房屋租赁解释第5条）不属挂载条文，未写\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c718">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subleaseContractOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Sub</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subleaseUnder"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordKnewOrShouldKnowSublease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noObjectionWithin6Months"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordConsentedToSublease"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c728-comp">
      <lrml:Comment>出租人未通知承租人或者有其他妨害承租人行使优先购买权情形的，承租人可以请求出租人承担赔偿责任；以承租人享有优先购买权为前提，故沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c728-comp", "articles": ["728"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5260", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第728条赔偿规则沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属），原文没有，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：第704条为提示性条款未写规则；一房数租（房屋租赁解释第5条）不属挂载条文，未写\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c728-comp">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordSells"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordFailedToNotifySale"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherObstructionOfPreemption"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOwnerExercisesPreemption"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:saleToCloseRelative"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c728-comp-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出租人未通知承租人或者有其他妨害承租人行使优先购买权情形的，承租人可以请求出租人承担赔偿责任；以承租人享有优先购买权为前提，故沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimPreemptionInfringementDamages"/>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c728-validity">
      <lrml:Comment>但是，出租人与第三人订立的房屋买卖合同的效力不受影响
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c728-validity", "articles": ["728"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5260", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第728条赔偿规则沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属），原文没有，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：第704条为提示性条款未写规则；一房数租（房屋租赁解释第5条）不属挂载条文，未写\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c728-validity">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>KS</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Y</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:landlordFailedToNotifySale"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherObstructionOfPreemption"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:saleValidityUnaffectedByPreemptionInfringement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>KS</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c732">
      <lrml:Comment>承租人在房屋租赁期限内死亡的，与其生前共同居住的人或者共同经营人可以按照原租赁合同租赁该房屋
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c732", "articles": ["732"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5260", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第728条赔偿规则沿用第726条的两项除外（按份共有人行使优先购买权、出卖给近亲属），原文没有，请确认\n  · 起草者提示：第704条为提示性条款未写规则；一房数租（房屋租赁解释第5条）不属挂载条文，未写\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c732">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:houseLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:tenantOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:diedDuringLeaseTerm"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cohabitedWithTenant"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOperatorWithTenant"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Te</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c732-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>承租人在房屋租赁期限内死亡的，与其生前共同居住的人或者共同经营人可以按照原租赁合同租赁该房屋</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leaseOnOriginalTerms"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c648-defg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>供用电合同是供电人向用电人供电，用电人支付电费的合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c648-defg5041", "articles": ["648"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c648-defg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplierProvidesElectricityUserPays"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:powerSupplyContract"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c648-mustg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>向社会公众供电的供电人，不得拒绝用电人合理的订立合同要求
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c648-mustg5041", "articles": ["648"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c648-mustg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suppliesPowerToPublic"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reasonableContractRequest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c648-mustg5041-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>向社会公众供电的供电人，不得拒绝用电人合理的订立合同要求</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refuseContractConclusion"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c650-agreedg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>供用电合同的履行地点，按照当事人约定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c650-agreedg5041", "articles": ["650"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c650-agreedg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:powerSupplyContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearSupplyPerformancePlace"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplyPerformancePlacePerAgreement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c650-defaultg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>当事人没有约定或者约定不明确的，供电设施的产权分界处为履行地点
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c650-defaultg5041", "articles": ["650"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c650-defaultg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:powerSupplyContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedOrUnclearSupplyPerformancePlace"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performancePlaceIs"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Ind>supplyFacilityPropertyBoundary</ruleml:Ind>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c651-safeg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>供电人应当按照国家规定的供电质量标准和约定安全供电
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c651-safeg5041", "articles": ["651"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c651-safeg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:powerSupplierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:electricityUserOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c651-safeg5041-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>供电人应当按照国家规定的供电质量标准和约定安全供电</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supplySafelyPerStateStandardAndAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c651-liabg5041">
