            <lrml:Obligation key="c654-penaltyg5041-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>用电人逾期不支付电费的，应当按照约定支付违约金</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payAgreedLiquidatedDamagesForCharges"/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c654-suspendg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>经催告用电人在合理期限内仍不支付电费和违约金的，供电人可以按照国家规定的程序中止供电
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c654-suspendg5041", "articles": ["654"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c654-suspendg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:powerSupplierOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:electricityUserOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:electricityChargesOverdue"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unpaidAfterDemandWithinReasonablePeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c654-suspendg5041-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>经催告用电人在合理期限内仍不支付电费和违约金的，供电人可以按照国家规定的程序中止供电</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suspendSupplyPerStateProcedure"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c654-noticeg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>供电人依据前款规定中止供电的，应当事先通知用电人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c654-noticeg5041", "articles": ["654"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c654-noticeg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
