    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c656-refg5041">
      <lrml:Comment>供用水、供用气、供用热力合同，参照适用供用电合同的有关规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c656-refg5041", "articles": ["656"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5041", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第654条违约金规则的规则体里加了 liquidatedDamages(K)（约定了违约金），因为条文说的是“按照约定支付违约金”\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c656-refg5041">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:waterSupplyContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:gasSupplyContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heatSupplyContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyPowerSupplyRulesByReference"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c510-suppg4158">
      <lrml:Comment>合同生效后，就质量、价款或者报酬、履行地点等没有约定或约定不明确的，可以协议补充
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c510-suppg4158", "articles": ["510"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4158", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第1–6项按“内容事项”常量（quality/price/place/term/method/cost）分规则写；质量标准的先后顺序用 ~standardExists 串成递进链\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第4项“应当给对方必要的准备时间”写成双方互负的义务，是对条文的一种读法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c510-suppg4158">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termNotAgreedOrUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c510-suppg4158-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>合同生效后，就质量、价款或者报酬、履行地点等没有约定或约定不明确的，可以协议补充</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concludeSupplementaryAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c510-fillg4158">
      <lrml:Comment>不能达成补充协议的，按照合同相关条款或者交易习惯确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c510-fillg4158", "articles": ["510"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4158", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第1–6项按“内容事项”常量（quality/price/place/term/method/cost）分规则写；质量标准的先后顺序用 ~standardExists 串成递进链\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第4项“应当给对方必要的准备时间”写成双方互负的义务，是对条文的一种读法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c510-fillg4158">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractEffective"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:termNotAgreedOrUnclear"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noSupplementaryAgreementOn"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:determinedByRelatedClausesOrUsage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>I</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c511-q1g4158">
      <lrml:Comment>质量要求不明确的，按照强制性国家标准履行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c511-q1g4158", "articles": ["511"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4158", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第1–6项按“内容事项”常量（quality/price/place/term/method/cost）分规则写；质量标准的先后顺序用 ~standardExists 串成递进链\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第4项“应当给对方必要的准备时间”写成双方互负的义务，是对条文的一种读法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c511-q1g4158">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillIndeterminableAfterArt510"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Ind>quality</ruleml:Ind>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:standardExists"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Ind>mandatoryNational</ruleml:Ind>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:qualityStandardApplied"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Ind>mandatoryNational</ruleml:Ind>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c511-q2g4158">
      <lrml:Comment>没有强制性国家标准的，按照推荐性国家标准履行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c511-q2g4158", "articles": ["511"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4158", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第1–6项按“内容事项”常量（quality/price/place/term/method/cost）分规则写；质量标准的先后顺序用 ~standardExists 串成递进链\n  · 起草者提示：第511条第4项“应当给对方必要的准备时间”写成双方互负的义务，是对条文的一种读法\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c511-q2g4158">
