      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c512-courierg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:electronicContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodsDeliveredByCourier"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseOnDeliveryOrServiceTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deliveryTimeIs"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Ind>consigneeSigningTime</ruleml:Ind>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c512-serviceg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>电子合同标的为提供服务的，生成的电子凭证或者实物凭证中载明的时间为提供服务时间
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c512-serviceg4164", "articles": ["512"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c512-serviceg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:electronicContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:serviceProvision"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voucherTimeMissingOrInconsistent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
