      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c513-latepickupdowng4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:governmentPricingRequired"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lateTakingOfDelivery"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:latePayment"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:governmentPriceChange"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Ind>down</ruleml:Ind>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pricedAt"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Ind>originalPrice</ruleml:Ind>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c514-currencyg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>以支付金钱为内容的债，除法律另有规定或者当事人另有约定外，债权人可以请求债务人以实际履行地的法定货币履行
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c514-currencyg4164", "articles": ["514"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c514-currencyg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:monetaryDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractObligorTo"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:currencyOtherwiseProvidedOrAgreed"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c514-currencyg4164-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:demandPaymentInLocalLegalTender"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c531-refuseg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>债权人可以拒绝债务人部分履行债务，但是部分履行不损害债权人利益的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c531-refuseg4164", "articles": ["531"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c531-refuseg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractObligorTo"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partialPerformanceTendered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partialPerformanceHarmless"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c531-refuseg4164-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refusePartialPerformance"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c531-costg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>债务人部分履行债务给债权人增加的费用，由债务人负担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c531-costg4164", "articles": ["531"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c531-costg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractObligorTo"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partialPerformanceTendered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partialPerformanceIncreasedCost"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c531-costg4164-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>债务人部分履行债务给债权人增加的费用，由债务人负担</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearPartialPerformanceCost"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c603-agreedg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>出卖人应当按照约定的地点交付标的物
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c603-agreedg4164", "articles": ["603"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c603-agreedg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sellerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedDeliveryPlace"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c603-agreedg4164-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>出卖人应当按照约定的地点交付标的物</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deliverAtAgreedPlace"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c603-carrierg4164">
      <lrml:Comment>没有约定交付地点或者约定不明确，依第510条仍不能确定，标的物需要运输的，出卖人应当将标的物交付给第一承运人以运交给买受人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c603-carrierg4164", "articles": ["603"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4164", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第603条交付地点的规则声明优先于第511条第3项，依据是笔记里“分则补充先于通则补充”的顺序\n  · 起草者提示：第513条政府定价调整按上涨/下降、逾期交付/逾期提货或付款分成 5 条规则\n  · 起草者提示：第501条沿用了其他草稿已有的 knowsConfidentialInfo/disclosesOrImproperlyUses/discloseOrUseConfidentialInfo（只有行为人和对方两个参数，没有“信息”参数）\n  · 起草者提示：第510–512条的规则与 card:g4158 相同（从该行复制，只换了 key）\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c603-carrierg4164">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sellerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noAgreedDeliveryPlace"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillIndeterminableAfterArt510"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Ind>place</ruleml:Ind>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractGoodsNeedCarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c603-carrierg4164-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>没有约定交付地点或者约定不明确，依第510条仍不能确定，标的物需要运输的，出卖人应当将标的物交付给第一承运人以运交给买受人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handOverToFirstCarrier"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c603-knowng4164">
      <lrml:Comment>标的物不需要运输，出卖人和买受人订立合同时知道标的物在某一地点的，出卖人应当在该地点交付
