      <lrml:Comment>夫妻双方都有各自使用自己姓名的权利
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1056", "articles": ["1056"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1056", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1056">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
