    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1060-1">
      <lrml:Comment>夫妻一方因家庭日常生活需要而实施的民事法律行为，对夫妻双方发生效力，但是夫妻一方与相对人另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1060-1", "articles": ["1060"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1060", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第2款的反面推论（内部限制可对抗知情相对人，并因此排除对另一方生效）写为学理，请核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1060-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forDailyHouseholdNeeds"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseWithCounterparty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bindsSpouse"/>
            <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1060-2">
      <lrml:Comment>夫妻之间对一方可以实施的民事法律行为范围的限制，不得对抗善意相对人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1060-2", "articles": ["1060"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1060", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第2款的反面推论（内部限制可对抗知情相对人，并因此排除对另一方生效）写为学理，请核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1060-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spousalActRestrictionCovers"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:counterpartyOfAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodFaithAsToSpousalRestriction"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restrictionOpposable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>J</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1060-opp">
      <lrml:Comment>第1060条第2款的反面解释（学理）：相对人知道该内部限制的，限制可以对抗该相对人
