      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1083">
      <lrml:Comment>离婚后，男女双方自愿恢复婚姻关系的，应当到婚姻登记机关重新进行结婚登记
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1083", "articles": ["1083"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1083", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1083">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageDissolved"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mutuallyWishToRemarry"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1083-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>离婚后，男女双方自愿恢复婚姻关系的，应当到婚姻登记机关重新进行结婚登记</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reregisterMarriage"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1084-1">
      <lrml:Comment>父母与子女间的关系，不因父母离婚而消除；子女无论由父或者母直接抚养，仍是父母双方的子女
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1084-1", "articles": ["1084"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6786", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“尊重八周岁以上子女意愿”的义务只写给法院；第1086条第3款中止探望后未写对探望权的否定\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1084-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageDissolved"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:parentChildRelationUnaffectedByDivorce"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
