    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1086-restore">
      <lrml:Comment>中止的事由消失后，应当恢复探望
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1086-restore", "articles": ["1086"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6786", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“尊重八周岁以上子女意愿”的义务只写给法院；第1086条第3款中止探望后未写对探望权的否定\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1086-restore">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:visitationSuspended"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:suspensionGroundCeased"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1086-restore-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>中止的事由消失后，应当恢复探望</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:restoreVisitation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1081">
      <lrml:Comment>现役军人的配偶要求离婚，应当征得军人同意，但是军人一方有重大过错的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1081", "articles": ["1081"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6745", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“未经军人同意法院不得判离”为学理，压住 c1079-2/-3/-5；第1082条只写男方“不得提出”，法院“不予受理”未形式化\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1081">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:activeServicemember"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestsDivorce"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servicememberGrossFault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1081-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>现役军人的配偶要求离婚，应当征得军人同意，但是军人一方有重大过错的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainServicememberConsent"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1081-court">
      <lrml:Comment>学理：第1081条的法律效果为，未征得军人同意且军人无重大过错的，人民法院不得判决准予离婚
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1081-court", "articles": ["1081"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6745", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“未经军人同意法院不得判离”为学理，压住 c1079-2/-3/-5；第1082条只写男方“不得提出”，法院“不予受理”未形式化\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1081-court">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:activeServicemember"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:divorceSuitFiled"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servicememberConsented"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servicememberGrossFault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c1081-court-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>学理：第1081条的法律效果为，未征得军人同意且军人无重大过错的，人民法院不得判决准予离婚</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grantDivorce"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1081-spc64">
      <lrml:Comment>《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民法典〉婚姻家庭编的解释（一）》第64条：“军人一方有重大过错”，可以依据第1079条第3款前三项规定及军人有其他重大过错导致夫妻感情破裂的情形予以判断
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1081-spc64", "articles": ["1081"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6745", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“未经军人同意法院不得判离”为学理，压住 c1079-2/-3/-5；第1082条只写男方“不得提出”，法院“不予受理”未形式化\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1081-spc64">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:activeServicemember"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bigamy"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cohabitingWithOther"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:committedDomesticViolence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:abuseOrDesertFamilyMember"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:incorrigibleGamblingOrDrugVice"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherGrossFaultCausingBreakdown"/>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servicememberGrossFault"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1082">
      <lrml:Comment>女方在怀孕期间、分娩后一年内或者终止妊娠后六个月内，男方不得提出离婚；但是，女方提出离婚或者人民法院认为确有必要受理男方离婚请求的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1082", "articles": ["1082"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6745", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“未经军人同意法院不得判离”为学理，压住 c1079-2/-3/-5；第1082条只写男方“不得提出”，法院“不予受理”未形式化\n  · 起草者提示：《婚姻家庭编解释（一）》条号按最高法官网摘要核对，未逐字核对原文；《婚姻家庭编解释（二）》（2025）未核对、未使用\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1082">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:husbandOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inPregnancyOrPostnatalProtectedPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wifeProposedDivorce"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtDeemsNecessaryToAcceptHusbandsClaim"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c1082-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>女方在怀孕期间、分娩后一年内或者终止妊娠后六个月内，男方不得提出离婚；但是，女方提出离婚或者人民法院认为确有必要受理男方离婚请求的除外</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:proposeDivorce"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1087-agree">
      <lrml:Comment>离婚时，夫妻的共同财产由双方协议处理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1087-agree", "articles": ["1087"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6820", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1091-spc87 与 c1091 结论内容不同，override 只是标记，实际排除靠 c1091 体内的 marriageDissolved\n  · 起草者提示：新谓词 propertyOfMarriage 挂夫妻二人，与第1066条用婚姻对象 M 的写法不一致\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1087-agree">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:atDivorce"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyOfMarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1087-agree-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>离婚时，夫妻的共同财产由双方协议处理</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreeOnPropertyDivision"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1087-court">
      <lrml:Comment>协议不成的，由人民法院根据财产的具体情况，按照照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益的原则判决
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1087-court", "articles": ["1087"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6820", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c1091-spc87 与 c1091 结论内容不同，override 只是标记，实际排除靠 c1091 体内的 marriageDissolved\n  · 起草者提示：新谓词 propertyOfMarriage 挂夫妻二人，与第1066条用婚姻对象 M 的写法不一致\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1087-court">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:atDivorce"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:communityProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyOfMarriage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:propertyDivisionAgreementFailed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1087-court-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>协议不成的，由人民法院根据财产的具体情况，按照照顾子女、女方和无过错方权益的原则判决</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:divideFavoringChildrenWomanAndInnocentParty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1087-2">
      <lrml:Comment>对夫或者妻在家庭土地承包经营中享有的权益等，应当依法予以保护
