    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1137-form">
      <lrml:Comment>录音录像遗嘱应当有两个以上见证人在场见证，遗嘱人和见证人应当在录音录像中记录其姓名或者肖像，以及年、月、日
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1137-form", "articles": ["1137"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1137", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”按通说写为学理；见证人人数无法计数，用单一谓词表达\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1137-form">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:audioVideoWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:namesOrImagesRecorded"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:datedYMD"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1137-void">
      <lrml:Comment>学理通说：不符合法定形式要件的录音录像遗嘱不发生遗嘱效力；民法典未明文规定此效果
