CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-2", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1133-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>自然人可以立遗嘱将个人财产指定由法定继承人中的一人或者数人继承</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:designateHeirByWill"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1133-3">
      <lrml:Comment>自然人可以立遗嘱将个人财产赠与国家、集体或者法定继承人以外的组织、个人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-3", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-3">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:state"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:collectiveOrg"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1133-3-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>自然人可以立遗嘱将个人财产赠与国家、集体或者法定继承人以外的组织、个人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bequeathTo"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1133-4">
      <lrml:Comment>自然人可以依法设立遗嘱信托
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-4", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-4">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1133-4-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>自然人可以依法设立遗嘱信托</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:establishTestamentaryTrust"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1133-heir">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱将个人财产指定由法定继承人继承的，该人为遗嘱继承人（学理归纳）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-heir", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-heir">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willGives"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:testamentaryHeirOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1133-legatee">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱将个人财产赠与法定继承人以外的国家、集体、组织或个人的，为遗赠，该人为受遗赠人（学理归纳）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-legatee", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-legatee">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willGives"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legateeOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1133-spc26">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第26条：遗嘱人以遗嘱处分了国家、集体或者他人财产的，应当认定该部分遗嘱无效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1133-spc26", "articles": ["1133"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1133", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：遗嘱继承人与受遗赠人按受益人是否属于法定继承人划分，标为学理；新三元谓词 willGives(W,H,X) 被第1144、1154、1158条依赖\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1133-spc26">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willGives"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notPropertyOfTestator"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoidAsTo"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1136-form">
      <lrml:Comment>打印遗嘱应当有两个以上见证人在场见证；遗嘱人和见证人应当在遗嘱每一页签名，注明年、月、日
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1136-form", "articles": ["1136"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1136-form">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:printedWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eachPageSignedAndDatedByTestatorAndWitnesses"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1136-void">
      <lrml:Comment>学理通说：不符合法定形式要件的打印遗嘱不发生遗嘱效力；民法典未明文规定此效果
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1136-void", "articles": ["1136"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1136-void">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:printedWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1138-perm">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱人在危急情况下，可以立口头遗嘱
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1138-perm", "articles": ["1138"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1138-perm">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inEmergency"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1138-perm-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗嘱人在危急情况下，可以立口头遗嘱</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:makeOralWill"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1138-form">
      <lrml:Comment>口头遗嘱须在危急情况下订立，并应当有两个以上见证人在场见证
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1138-form", "articles": ["1138"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1138-form">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:oralWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:madeInEmergency"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1138-void">
      <lrml:Comment>学理通说：非危急情况或无两个以上见证人见证的口头遗嘱不发生效力；民法典未明文规定此效果
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1138-void", "articles": ["1138"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1138-void">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:oralWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1138-lapse">
      <lrml:Comment>危急情况消除后，遗嘱人能够以书面或者录音录像形式立遗嘱的，所立的口头遗嘱无效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1138-lapse", "articles": ["1138"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1138-lapse">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
