    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1141">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱应当为缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源的继承人保留必要的遗产份额
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1141", "articles": ["1141"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1141">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksWorkAbility"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noLivelihood"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1141-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗嘱应当为缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源的继承人保留必要的遗产份额</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reserveNecessaryShareInWill"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1141-spc25">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第25条：遗嘱未保留的，遗产处理时应当为该继承人留下必要的遗产，剩余部分才可参照遗嘱处理；是否缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源按遗嘱生效时的情况确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1141-spc25", "articles": ["1141"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1141-spc25">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksWorkAbility"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noLivelihood"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessaryShareReserved"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1141-spc25-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承编解释（一）第25条：遗嘱未保留的，遗产处理时应当为该继承人留下必要的遗产，剩余部分才可参照遗嘱处理；是否缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源按遗嘱生效时的情况确定</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:setAsideNecessaryShareFirst"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1142-1">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱人可以撤回、变更自己所立的遗嘱
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1142-1", "articles": ["1142"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7149", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1142条第2、3款已有基础规则 c1142-2/-3，本行只写第1款；打印、口头遗嘱形式不合格无效为学理\n  · 起草者提示：第1141条必留份用 bearer=D 的义务表达；继承编解释第25条“按遗嘱生效时情况认定”只写在 note\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1142-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1142-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗嘱人可以撤回、变更自己所立的遗嘱</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revokeOrAmendWill"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1135-form">
      <lrml:Comment>代书遗嘱应当有两个以上见证人在场见证，由其中一人代书，并由遗嘱人、代书人和其他见证人签名，注明年、月、日
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1135-form", "articles": ["1135"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1135", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”按通说写为学理；见证人“两人以上且合格”用 twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent 表达，无法计数\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1135-form">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:scribedWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:scribedByOneWitness"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:signedByTestatorScribeAndWitnesses"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:datedYMD"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1135-void">
      <lrml:Comment>学理通说：不符合法定形式要件的代书遗嘱不发生遗嘱效力；民法典未明文规定此效果
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1135-void", "articles": ["1135"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1135", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”按通说写为学理；见证人“两人以上且合格”用 twoOrMoreQualifiedWitnessesPresent 表达，无法计数\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1135-void">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:scribedWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1134-form">
      <lrml:Comment>自书遗嘱由遗嘱人亲笔书写，签名，注明年、月、日
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1134-form", "articles": ["1134"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1134", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”法条未明文，按通说写为学理\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1134-form">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:holographicWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handwrittenByTestator"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:signedByTestator"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:datedYMD"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1134-void">
      <lrml:Comment>学理通说：遗嘱为要式行为，不符合法定形式要件的自书遗嘱不发生遗嘱效力；民法典未明文规定此效果
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1134-void", "articles": ["1134"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1134", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”法条未明文，按通说写为学理\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1134-void">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:holographicWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
                <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willVoid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1134-spc27">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第27条：遗书涉及死后个人财产处分，确为真实意思表示，有本人签名并注明年月日，又无相反证据的，可以按自书遗嘱对待
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1134-spc27", "articles": ["1134"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1134", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：“形式不合格的遗嘱无效”法条未明文，按通说写为学理\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1134-spc27">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:posthumousNote"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disposesPropertyAfterDeath"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trueIntentOfDeceased"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:signedByTestator"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:datedYMD"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contraryEvidence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:holographicWill"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>N</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willFormMet"/>
