            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1131-elig">
      <lrml:Comment>继承人以外的依靠被继承人扶养的人，或者继承人以外的对被继承人扶养较多的人，属于可以分给适当遗产的人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1131-elig", "articles": ["1131"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1131", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：继承编解释第10条能否触发取决于基础规则是否仍把生子女算作生父母的继承人；若算，“继承人以外”条件会把被收养人排除\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1131-elig">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dependentOnDeceased"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportedDeceasedConsiderably"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleForDiscretionaryShare"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1131-perm">
      <lrml:Comment>对上述人员，可以分给适当的遗产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1131-perm", "articles": ["1131"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1131", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：继承编解释第10条能否触发取决于基础规则是否仍把生子女算作生父母的继承人；若算，“继承人以外”条件会把被收养人排除\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1131-perm">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleForDiscretionaryShare"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1131-perm-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>对上述人员，可以分给适当的遗产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allotAppropriateShare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1131-spc10">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第10条：被收养人对养父母尽了赡养义务，同时又对生父母扶养较多的，除继承养父母遗产外，还可依第1131条分得生父母适当的遗产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1131-spc10", "articles": ["1131"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1131", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：继承编解释第10条能否触发取决于基础规则是否仍把生子女算作生父母的继承人；若算，“继承人以外”条件会把被收养人排除\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1131-spc10">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adoptedChild"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportDutyPerformed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:biologicalParent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportedDeceasedConsiderably"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleForDiscretionaryShare"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1131-spc17">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第17条：继承人丧失继承权的，其晚辈直系血亲不得代位继承；该代位继承人缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源，或者对被继承人尽赡养义务较多的，可以适当分给遗产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1131-spc17", "articles": ["1131"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1131", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：继承编解释第10条能否触发取决于基础规则是否仍把生子女算作生父母的继承人；若算，“继承人以外”条件会把被收养人排除\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1131-spc17">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:childOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lineaDescendant"/>
              <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:And>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksWorkAbility"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noLivelihood"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
              </ruleml:And>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportedDeceasedConsiderably"/>
                <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:eligibleForDiscretionaryShare"/>
            <ruleml:Var>G</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1131-spc20">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第20条：分给他们遗产时，按具体情况可以多于或者少于继承人
