              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableToSupport"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willingToSupport"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deceasedDeclinedSupport"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c1130-spc22-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承编解释（一）第22条：继承人愿尽扶养义务，但被继承人因有固定收入和劳动能力明确表示不要求其扶养的，分配遗产时一般不应因此影响其继承份额</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allotNoneOrLess"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1130-spc23">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第23条：有扶养能力和条件的继承人虽与被继承人共同生活，但对需要扶养的被继承人不尽扶养义务的，可以少分或者不分
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1130-spc23", "articles": ["1130"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1130", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：份额按“遗产整体是否均等”建模，第2–5款各推出不均等事由并以“除非”排除均等规则\n  · 起草者提示：继承编解释第23条（“可以”少分）与本条第4款（“应当”不分或少分）并存，未写优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1130-spc23">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ableToSupport"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:livedWithDeceased"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deceasedNeededSupport"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failedSupportDuty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1130-spc23-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承编解释（一）第23条：有扶养能力和条件的继承人虽与被继承人共同生活，但对需要扶养的被继承人不尽扶养义务的，可以少分或者不分</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:allotNoneOrLess"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unequalShareGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1132-agree">
      <lrml:Comment>继承人应当协商处理继承问题；遗产分割的时间、办法和份额，由继承人协商确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1132-agree", "articles": ["1132"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1132-agree">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partitionAgreedByHeirs"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partitionPerAgreement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1132-fail">
      <lrml:Comment>协商不成的，可以由人民调解委员会调解或者向人民法院提起诉讼
