    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1146">
      <lrml:Comment>对遗产管理人的确定有争议的，利害关系人可以向人民法院申请指定遗产管理人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1146", "articles": ["1146"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1146">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:successionStarted"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:administratorDisputed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interestedParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1146-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>对遗产管理人的确定有争议的，利害关系人可以向人民法院申请指定遗产管理人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyAdministratorDesignation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1147">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1147", "articles": ["1147"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1147">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateAdministratorOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inventoryEstate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reportEstateToHeirs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h2">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preventEstateLoss"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h3">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handleDeceasedClaimsAndDebts"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h4">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partitionPerWillOrLaw"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1147-h5">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当清理遗产并制作清单、向继承人报告、防止遗产毁损灭失、处理债权债务、按照遗嘱或依法分割遗产、实施其他必要行为</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherNecessaryAdminActs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1148-1">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产管理人应当依法履行职责
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1148-1", "articles": ["1148"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1148-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateAdministratorOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1148-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人应当依法履行职责</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performAdminDutiesLawfully"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1148-2">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产管理人因故意或者重大过失造成继承人、受遗赠人、债权人损害的，应当承担民事责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1148-2", "articles": ["1148"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1148-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateAdministratorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damagedByAdministrator"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legateeOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:creditorOfDeceased"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentional"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:grossNegligence"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1148-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人因故意或者重大过失造成继承人、受遗赠人、债权人损害的，应当承担民事责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearCivilLiability"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1149">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产管理人可以依照法律规定或者按照约定获得报酬
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1149", "articles": ["1149"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1149">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateAdministratorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:remunerationProvidedByLaw"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adminRemunerationAgreed"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1149-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产管理人可以依照法律规定或者按照约定获得报酬</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:receiveAdminRemuneration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1153-1">
      <lrml:Comment>夫妻共同所有的财产，除有约定的外，遗产分割时，应当先将共同所有的财产的一半分出为配偶所有，其余的为被继承人的遗产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1153-1", "articles": ["1153"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1153-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maritalCommonProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maritalPropertyAgreement"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownedBySpouseHalf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:halfIsEstate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1153-1-h2">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>夫妻共同所有的财产，除有约定的外，遗产分割时，应当先将共同所有的财产的一半分出为配偶所有，其余的为被继承人的遗产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separateSpouseHalf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1153-2">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产在家庭共有财产之中的，遗产分割时，应当先分出他人的财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1153-2", "articles": ["1153"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1153-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:familyCommonProperty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1153-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产在家庭共有财产之中的，遗产分割时，应当先分出他人的财产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separateOthersProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1153-other">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记（学理）：遗产与合伙财产等其他共有财产的区分，同样先分出他人的财产，剩余的为遗产；法条仅规定夫妻共同财产与家庭共有财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1153-other", "articles": ["1153"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1153-other">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOwnedWithOthers"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1153-other-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>笔记（学理）：遗产与合伙财产等其他共有财产的区分，同样先分出他人的财产，剩余的为遗产；法条仅规定夫妻共同财产与家庭共有财产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:separateOthersProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1155-1">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产分割时，应当保留胎儿的继承份额
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1155-1", "articles": ["1155"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1155-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetus"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:prospectiveHeirFetus"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1155-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产分割时，应当保留胎儿的继承份额</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reserveFetusShare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1155-2">
      <lrml:Comment>胎儿娩出时是死体的，保留的份额按照法定继承办理（继承编解释一第31条：由被继承人的继承人继承）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1155-2", "articles": ["1155"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1155-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reservedFetusShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stillborn"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1155-spc31a">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第31条第1款：应当为胎儿保留的遗产份额没有保留的，应从继承人所继承的遗产中扣回
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1155-spc31a", "articles": ["1155"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1155-spc31a">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetus"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:prospectiveHeirFetus"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fetusShareNotReserved"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1155-spc31a-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承编解释（一）第31条第1款：应当为胎儿保留的遗产份额没有保留的，应从继承人所继承的遗产中扣回</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recoupFetusShareFromHeirs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1155-spc31b">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第31条第2款：为胎儿保留的遗产份额，如胎儿出生后死亡的，由其继承人继承
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1155-spc31b", "articles": ["1155"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1155-spc31b">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reservedFetusShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:born"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:died"/>
              <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritedByHeirsOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>F</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1156-1">
      <lrml:Comment>遗产分割应当有利于生产和生活需要，不损害遗产的效用
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1156-1", "articles": ["1156"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1156-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1156-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>遗产分割应当有利于生产和生活需要，不损害遗产的效用</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partitionPreservingUtility"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1156-2">
      <lrml:Comment>不宜分割的遗产，可以采取折价、适当补偿或者共有等方法处理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1156-2", "articles": ["1156"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1156-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unsuitableForPartition"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1156-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>不宜分割的遗产，可以采取折价、适当补偿或者共有等方法处理</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:handleByValuationCompensationOrCoOwnership"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1156-spc42">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第42条：人民法院分割遗产中的房屋、生产资料和特定职业所需要的财产时，应当依据有利于发挥其使用效益和继承人的实际需要，兼顾各继承人的利益进行处理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1156-spc42", "articles": ["1156"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1156-spc42">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:house"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:productionMeans"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:professionSpecificProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1156-spc42-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承编解释（一）第42条：人民法院分割遗产中的房屋、生产资料和特定职业所需要的财产时，应当依据有利于发挥其使用效益和继承人的实际需要，兼顾各继承人的利益进行处理</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partitionByUseEfficiencyAndNeeds"/>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1159-1">
      <lrml:Comment>分割遗产，应当清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1159-1", "articles": ["1159"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1159-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesTaxOrDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1159-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>分割遗产，应当清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payDeceasedTaxAndDebtsFromEstate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1159-2">
      <lrml:Comment>但是，应当为缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源的继承人保留必要的遗产（即使遗产不足清偿债务）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1159-2", "articles": ["1159"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1159-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lacksWorkAbility"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noLivelihood"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1159-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>但是，应当为缺乏劳动能力又没有生活来源的继承人保留必要的遗产（即使遗产不足清偿债务）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reserveNecessaryEstate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1161-1">
      <lrml:Comment>继承人以所得遗产实际价值为限清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1161-1", "articles": ["1161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1161-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:successionStarted"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesTaxOrDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1161-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承人以所得遗产实际价值为限清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payDeceasedDebtsUpToEstateValue"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liableBeyondEstateValue"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1161-vol">
      <lrml:Comment>超过遗产实际价值部分，继承人自愿偿还的不在此限（不得以超出限额为由请求返还）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1161-vol", "articles": ["1161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1161-vol">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyPaidExcess"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessPaymentValid"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1161-2">
      <lrml:Comment>继承人放弃继承的，对被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务可以不负清偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1161-2", "articles": ["1161"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1161-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heirCandidate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesTaxOrDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c1161-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>继承人放弃继承的，对被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务可以不负清偿责任</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notPayDeceasedDebts"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1162">
      <lrml:Comment>执行遗赠不得妨碍清偿遗赠人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1162", "articles": ["1162"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1162">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legateeOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesTaxOrDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c1162-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>执行遗赠不得妨碍清偿遗赠人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>estateDistributor</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:executeBequestImpairingDebtPayment"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1163-1">
      <lrml:Comment>既有法定继承又有遗嘱继承、遗赠的，由法定继承人清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1163-1", "articles": ["1163"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1163-1">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mixedSuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:owesTaxOrDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1163-1-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>既有法定继承又有遗嘱继承、遗赠的，由法定继承人清偿被继承人依法应当缴纳的税款和债务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payDebtsFromIntestateShareFirst"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1163-2">
      <lrml:Comment>超过法定继承遗产实际价值部分，由遗嘱继承人和受遗赠人按比例以所得遗产清偿
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1163-2", "articles": ["1163"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7245", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1145条“继承人”借用 heirCandidate（法定继承人），未覆盖法定继承人以外的遗嘱受益人\n  · 起草者提示：第1159条但书与第1162、1163条清偿顺序只写在 nl.priority，未写 overrides；分配遗产一方用常量 estateDistributor、国家用 state，请确认\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1163-2">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mixedSuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtsExceedIntestateEstate"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:testamentaryHeirOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legateeOf"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1163-2-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>超过法定继承遗产实际价值部分，由遗嘱继承人和受遗赠人按比例以所得遗产清偿</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payExcessDebtsProRata"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1157">
      <lrml:Comment>夫妻一方死亡后另一方再婚的，有权处分所继承的财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1157", "articles": ["1157"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1157", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1157">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredBySuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRemarried"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c1157-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disposeInheritedProperty"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1157-noint">
      <lrml:Comment>任何组织或者个人不得干涉其处分所继承的财产
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1157-noint", "articles": ["1157"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:1157", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1157-noint">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:dead"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiredBySuccession"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:spouseRemarried"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c1157-noint-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>任何组织或者个人不得干涉其处分所继承的财产</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interfereInAffair"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1152">
      <lrml:Comment>继承开始后，继承人于遗产分割前死亡，并没有放弃继承的，该继承人应当继承的遗产转给其继承人，但是遗嘱另有安排的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1152", "articles": ["1152"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1152">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:successionStarted"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsIntestate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inheritsByWill"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:diedBeforePartition"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willProvidesOtherwise"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shareTransfersToHeirsOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1152-spc38">
      <lrml:Comment>继承编解释（一）第38条：继承开始后，受遗赠人表示接受遗赠，并于遗产分割前死亡的，其接受遗赠的权利转移给他的继承人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1152-spc38", "articles": ["1152"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1152-spc38">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:legateeOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acceptedBequest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:diedBeforePartition"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bequestRightTransfersToHeirsOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1154-lapse">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱继承人放弃继承或受遗赠人放弃受遗赠，遗嘱继承人丧失继承权或受遗赠人丧失受遗赠权，遗嘱继承人、受遗赠人先于遗嘱人死亡或者终止的，遗产中的有关部分按照法定继承办理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1154-lapse", "articles": ["1154"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1154-lapse">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:willGives"/>
              <ruleml:Var>W</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renounced"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:renouncedBequest"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disinherited"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lostBequestRight"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:predeceased"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:terminatedBeforeTestator"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:supportAgreementCovers"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:effectiveWillCovers"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:byIntestacy"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1154-void">
      <lrml:Comment>遗嘱无效部分所涉及的遗产，按照法定继承办理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1154-void", "articles": ["1154"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
