    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1160-state">
      <lrml:Comment>无人继承又无人受遗赠的遗产，归国家所有，用于公益事业
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1160-state", "articles": ["1160"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1160-state">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noHeirOrLegatee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:vestsInState"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1160-state-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>无人继承又无人受遗赠的遗产，归国家所有，用于公益事业</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>state</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:useForPublicWelfare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1160-coll">
      <lrml:Comment>死者生前是集体所有制组织成员的，归所在集体所有制组织所有
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1160-coll", "articles": ["1160"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7086", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：第1152条“遗嘱另有安排”按被转继承人的遗嘱理解（依笔记），有争议\n  · 起草者提示：第1154条用 -effectiveWillCovers(E) 覆盖基础规则 c-will-effective\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1160-coll">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:estateOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noHeirOrLegatee"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:memberOfCollectiveOrg"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:vestsInCollectiveOrg"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:vestsInState"/>
