          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c997">
      <lrml:Comment>有证据证明行为人正在实施或即将实施侵害其人格权的违法行为，不及时制止将受难以弥补损害的，有权依法申请法院责令行为人停止有关行为
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c997", "articles": ["997"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6063", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：c999-excl（合理使用排除过错侵权责任）标为学理：条文只写“可以合理使用”，未明说不承担责任，是否升为法条明文请判断\n  · 起草者提示：c995-1 为指引性规范，构成要件仍依第1165–1167条；“损害赔偿请求权仍适用诉讼时效”的反面推论只写在区分栏；第996条见侵权编 c996\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c997">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:evidenceOfOngoingOrImminentInfringement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:irreparableHarmIfNotStopped"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c997-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:applyPersonalityInjunction"/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
