    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c991">
      <lrml:Comment>民事主体的人格权受法律保护，任何组织或者个人不得侵害
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c991", "articles": ["991"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:991", "model": "claude-agent", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 Claude agent 起草（司法解释为联网查证，是否逐字核对见起草者提示），已通过程序检查，待专家逐条核对\n  · 起草者提示：义务主体用 organizationOrIndividual(X) 泛化，与侵权责任规则之间未写优先关系\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c991">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:enjoyRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
