    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c85-revoke-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>人民法院撤销该决议的，决议即被撤销（条文“请求人民法院撤销”的当然含义）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c85-revoke-ds", "articles": ["85"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:85", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c85-revoke-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:resolutionRevocable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:courtRevokesResolution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:resolutionRevoked"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c85-effect-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>决议被撤销后，营利法人依据该决议与相对人形成的民事法律关系原则上失去效力；此系但书的反面推论，属学理结论，条文未明文
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c85-effect-ds", "articles": ["85"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:85", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c85-effect-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:resolutionRevoked"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relationFormedUnderResolution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validRelation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c85-but-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>但书：营利法人依据该决议与善意相对人形成的民事法律关系不受决议撤销的影响
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c85-but-ds", "articles": ["85"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:85", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c85-but-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forProfitLegalPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relationFormedUnderResolution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:validRelation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c199-start-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>法律规定或者当事人约定的撤销权、解除权等权利的存续期间，除法律另有规定外，自权利人知道或者应当知道权利产生之日起计算
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c199-start-ds", "articles": ["199"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:199", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c199-start-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:existencePeriodOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:holderOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:knowsOrShouldKnowRightArises"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnExistencePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:periodRunsFromKnowledge"/>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c199-other-law-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>法律对存续期间的起算另有规定的，依该规定计算，不适用自知道或者应当知道权利产生之日起算的规则
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c199-other-law-ds", "articles": ["199"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:199", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c199-other-law-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:existencePeriodOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnExistencePeriod"/>
