          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:thing"/>
            <ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c115-3-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>法律规定权利作为物权客体的，该权利即为物权客体，并依照该法律的规定处理
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c115-3-ds", "articles": ["115"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:115", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c115-3-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesRightAsRealRightObject"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:realRightObject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:rightAsObjectGovernedByItsProvision"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c120-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>民事权益受到侵害的，被侵权人有权请求侵权人承担侵权责任；本条只赋予请求权，构成要件与免责事由由侵权责任编规定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c120-1-ds", "articles": ["120"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:120", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c120-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:infringe"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawfulRightOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c120-1-ds-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimTortLiability"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c118-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>债权是因合同、侵权行为、无因管理、不当得利以及法律的其他规定，权利人请求特定义务人为或者不为一定行为的权利
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c118-2-ds", "articles": ["118"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3659", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c118-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilSubject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesFromContract"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesFromTort"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesFromNegotiorumGestio"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesFromUnjustEnrichment"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:arisesFromOtherLegalProvision"/>
                <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimRightOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c118-def-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：债是特定当事人之间可以请求为特定行为的民事法律关系，主体为债权人与债务人，内容为债权与债务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c118-def-ds", "articles": ["118"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3659", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c118-def-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimRightOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:civilSubject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtRelation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c118-object-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：债的客体（标的）是债务人的特定行为即给付，包括积极给付与消极给付
