        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:severalLiability"/>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1229-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>因污染环境、破坏生态造成他人损害的，侵权人应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任，不以过错为要件）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1229-1-ds", "articles": ["1229"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0317", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1229-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pollutesEnvironmentOrDestroysEcology"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamageTo"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c1229-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>因污染环境、破坏生态造成他人损害的，侵权人应当承担侵权责任（无过错责任，不以过错为要件）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearTortLiability"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1229-exc-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>第1230条只分配举证责任，未规定免责事由本身；存在法律规定的免责事由时排除第1229条责任，属学理归纳
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1229-exc-ds", "articles": ["1230"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g0317", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1229-exc-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pollutesEnvironmentOrDestroysEcology"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDamageTo"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>V</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exemptionOrMitigationGroundProvidedByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearTortLiability"/>
