                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:authorizedByHead"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:approvedByResponsiblePerson"/>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1222-presume-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>患者在诊疗活动中受损，医疗机构有违反诊疗规范、隐匿或拒绝提供病历、遗失伪造篡改违法销毁病历三种情形之一的，推定其有过错
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1222-presume-ds", "articles": ["1222"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7757", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1222-presume-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:medicalInstitution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:patient"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:treatedAt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatesDiagnosisNorms"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concealsOrRefusesRecords"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:losesForgesAltersOrDestroysRecords"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultPresumed"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1222-fault-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>推定过错即认定医疗机构有过错，但医疗机构举证证明自己没有过错的除外（举证责任倒置，可反驳的推定）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1222-fault-ds", "articles": ["1222"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7757", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1222-fault-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:faultPresumed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:patient"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:treatedAt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:provesNoFault"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1222-liable-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>医疗损害责任的四要件（违法诊疗行为、非正常损害、因果关系、过错）来自笔记与学理，第1222条只解决过错的认定方式；医务人员为行为主体，医疗机构为责任主体
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1222-liable-ds", "articles": ["1222"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7757", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1222-liable-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:medicalInstitution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:patient"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:treatedAt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unlawfulDiagnosisAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fault"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c1222-pay-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>构成医疗损害责任的，医疗机构应当向患者承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1222-pay-ds", "articles": ["1222"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7757", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1222-pay-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
            <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
