    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1224-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>患者或其近亲属不配合符合诊疗规范的诊疗、紧急情况下已尽合理诊疗义务、限于当时医疗水平难以诊疗的，医疗机构不承担赔偿责任
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1224-1-ds", "articles": ["1224"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g7757", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1224-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:medicalInstitution"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:patient"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:damage"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:treatedAt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:patientOrRelativeNonCooperation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:emergencyReasonableCare"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:beyondMedicalLevelAtTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:liable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>H</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1224-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>患者一方不配合的情形中，医疗机构或者其医务人员也有过错的，仍应当承担相应的赔偿责任
