    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c575-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>债权人免除债务人部分债务，债务人未在合理期限内拒绝的，债权债务部分终止
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c575-2-ds", "articles": ["575"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:575", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c575-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releasesPartOfDebt"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refusesReleaseWithinReasonableTime"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtTerminatedInPart"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c575-refuse-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>但书：债务人在合理期限内拒绝的，免除不发生效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c575-refuse-ds", "articles": ["575"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:575", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c575-refuse-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releasesDebt"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releasesPartOfDebt"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refusesReleaseWithinReasonableTime"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:releaseIneffective"/>
            <ruleml:Var>Debt</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c507-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>合同不生效、无效、被撤销或者终止的，不影响合同中有关解决争议方法的条款的效力，该条款仍然有效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c507-1-ds", "articles": ["507"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:507", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
