    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c622-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>约定的检验期限过短，依标的物性质和交易习惯买受人难以完成全面检验的，该期限仅视为对标的物外观瑕疵提出异议的期限
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c622-1-ds", "articles": ["622"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:622", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c622-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedInspectionPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectionPeriodTooShortForFullInspection"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appearanceDefectObjectionPeriod"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c622-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>约定的检验期限或质量保证期短于法律、行政法规规定期限的，以法定期间为准（该“应当”指向期间认定，非当事人义务，故写成构成性结论）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c622-2-ds", "articles": ["622"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:622", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c622-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedInspectionPeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedQualityGuaranteePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shorterThanStatutoryPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:statutoryPeriodPrevails"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c624-ground-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>出卖人依买受人指示向第三人交付标的物，且出卖人与买受人的检验标准同买受人与第三人的检验标准不一致
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c624-ground-ds", "articles": ["624"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:624", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c624-ground-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deliversToThirdPartyPerInstruction"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectionStandardAgreedBetween"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectionStandardAgreedBetween"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectionStandardsInconsistent"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inconsistentInspectionStandardCase"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c624-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>两个检验标准不一致时，以出卖人和买受人约定的检验标准为准
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c624-1-ds", "articles": ["624"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:624", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c624-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inconsistentInspectionStandardCase"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:controllingInspectionStandard"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c624-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>买受人与第三人约定的检验标准不能作为认定标的物是否符合约定的依据
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c624-2-ds", "articles": ["624"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:624", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c624-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inconsistentInspectionStandardCase"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:controllingInspectionStandard"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c624-inspect-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记将本条置于买受人及时检验义务项下，故买受人应按该标准检验标的物；条文本身只规定以何标准为准，此为学理归纳
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c624-inspect-ds", "articles": ["624"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:624", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c624-inspect-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:controllingInspectionStandard"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c624-inspect-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>笔记将本条置于买受人及时检验义务项下，故买受人应按该标准检验标的物；条文本身只规定以何标准为准，此为学理归纳</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inspectPerControllingStandard"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c625-ground-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>标的物在有效使用年限届满后应予回收，其依据为法律、行政法规的规定或者当事人的约定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c625-ground-ds", "articles": ["625"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:625", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c625-ground-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawOrAdminRegulationRequiresRecycling"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedRecycling"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Or>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recyclableAfterUsefulLife"/>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c625-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>标的物应予回收的，出卖人负有自行或者委托第三人对标的物予以回收的义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c625-1-ds", "articles": ["625"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:625", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c625-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sellerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recyclableAfterUsefulLife"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c625-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>标的物应予回收的，出卖人负有自行或者委托第三人对标的物予以回收的义务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recycleSubjectMatter"/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c626-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>买受人应当按照约定的数额和支付方式支付价款（sale(K,S,B,T)中S为出卖人、B为买受人、T为标的物）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c626-1-ds", "articles": ["626"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:626", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c626-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedPriceAmountAndMethod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c626-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>买受人应当按照约定的数额和支付方式支付价款（sale(K,S,B,T)中S为出卖人、B为买受人、T为标的物）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:payPrice"/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c626-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>对价款数额和支付方式没有约定或者约定不明确的，适用第510条、第511条第2项和第5项确定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c626-2-ds", "articles": ["626"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:626", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c626-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
