    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c640-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>试用买卖中，标的物在试用期内毁损、灭失的风险由出卖人承担，即不由买受人承担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c640-1-ds", "articles": ["640"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:640", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c640-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trialSale"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:subjectMatterOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withinTrialPeriod"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:goodsPerished"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnSeller"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:riskOnBuyer"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c640-doctrine-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记的学理说明：试用买卖在试用期内合同尚未生效，故风险不因交付而转移（条文未明定，仅为解释理由）
