              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c935-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>因委托人死亡或被宣告破产、解散致委托合同终止将损害委托人利益的，在继承人、遗产管理人或者清算人承受委托事务之前，受托人应当继续处理委托事务</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:continueHandlingEntrustedAffairs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c926-1a-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>受托人以自己名义与第三人订约、第三人不知代理关系，且因第三人原因对委托人不履行义务的，受托人应当向委托人披露第三人
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c926-1a-ds", "articles": ["926"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5774", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c926-1a-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustmentContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractsWithThirdPartyInOwnName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unawareOfAgencyRelation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causedByThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c926-1a-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>受托人以自己名义与第三人订约、第三人不知代理关系，且因第三人原因对委托人不履行义务的，受托人应当向委托人披露第三人</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disclosesThirdPartyToEntrustor"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c926-1b-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>受托人披露第三人后，委托人可以行使受托人对第三人的权利（介入权）；但第三人订立合同时知道该委托人就不会订立合同的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c926-1b-ds", "articles": ["926"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g5774", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c926-1b-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustmentContract"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:contractsWithThirdPartyInOwnName"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unawareOfAgencyRelation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K2</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causedByThirdParty"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:disclosesThirdPartyToEntrustor"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:wouldNotHaveContractedIfKnewEntrustor"/>
