    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c486-late-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>承诺迟延（迟到的承诺）包括两种情形：超过承诺期限发出承诺（迟发迟到）；在承诺期限内发出但按通常情形不能及时到达要约人（期内发亦迟到）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c486-late-ds", "articles": ["486"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:486", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c486-late-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acceptance"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:beyondAcceptancePeriod"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:And>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:withinAcceptancePeriod"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                  <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:cannotArriveInTime"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                  <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
              </ruleml:And>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lateAcceptance"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c486-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>迟到的承诺为新要约，不发生承诺的效力；但书（要约人及时通知该承诺有效）除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c486-1-ds", "articles": ["486"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:486", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c486-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lateAcceptance"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:offerorNotifiedEffective"/>
