    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c494-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>国家因抢险救灾、疫情防控或者其他需要下达国家订货任务、指令性任务的，有关民事主体之间应当依照有关法律、行政法规规定的权利和义务订立合同
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c494-1-ds", "articles": ["494"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:494", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c494-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stateIssuesOrderOrMandatoryTask"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forEmergencyReliefEpidemicOrOtherNeed"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantCivilSubject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:relevantCivilSubject"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c494-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>国家因抢险救灾、疫情防控或者其他需要下达国家订货任务、指令性任务的，有关民事主体之间应当依照有关法律、行政法规规定的权利和义务订立合同</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:concludeContractPerLawsAndRegs"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c494-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>依照法律、行政法规的规定负有发出要约义务的当事人，应当及时发出合理的要约
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c494-2-ds", "articles": ["494"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:494", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c494-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligatedToOfferByLaw"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c494-2-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>依照法律、行政法规的规定负有发出要约义务的当事人，应当及时发出合理的要约</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:makeReasonableOfferTimely"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c494-3-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>依照法律、行政法规的规定负有作出承诺义务的当事人，不得拒绝对方合理的订立合同要求
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c494-3-ds", "articles": ["494"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:494", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c494-3-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligatedToAcceptByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:reasonableContractRequest"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c494-3-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>依照法律、行政法规的规定负有作出承诺义务的当事人，不得拒绝对方合理的订立合同要求</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:refuseContractConclusion"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c494-doc-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记将第2、3款概括为“强制缔约”，即对缔约自由的法定限制；条文未使用该术语，属学理归纳
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c494-doc-ds", "articles": ["494"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:494", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c494-doc-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligatedToOfferByLaw"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obligatedToAcceptByLaw"/>
