              <lrml:Paraphrase>对格式条款的理解发生争议的，应当按照通常理解予以解释</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:interpretPerOrdinaryUnderstanding"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c498-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>对格式条款有两种以上解释的，应当作出不利于提供格式条款一方（P）的解释
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c498-2-ds", "articles": ["498"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:498", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c498-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:standardTerm"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:providedBy"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
