      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c538-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>有撤销事由的，债权人可以以自己的名义通过诉讼请求人民法院撤销债务人的行为（第538条、第539条效果相同）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c538-1-ds", "articles": ["538", "539"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c538-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtRelation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Permission key="c538-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>有撤销事由的，债权人可以以自己的名义通过诉讼请求人民法院撤销债务人的行为（第538条、第539条效果相同）</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:requestCourtRevokeAct"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Permission>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c540-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销权的行使范围以债权人的债权为限
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c540-1-ds", "articles": ["540"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4342", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c540-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesRevocation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationScopeLimitedToClaim"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c540-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>债权人行使撤销权的必要费用由债务人负担
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c540-2-ds", "articles": ["540"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4342", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c540-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesRevocation"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c540-2-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>债权人行使撤销权的必要费用由债务人负担</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:bearNecessaryExpensesOfRevocation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c541-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>撤销权自债权人知道或者应当知道撤销事由之日起一年内不行使的，该撤销权消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c541-1-ds", "articles": ["541"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c541-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:oneYearSinceKnewGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRightExtinguished"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c541-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>自债务人的行为发生之日起五年内没有行使撤销权的，该撤销权消灭
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c541-2-ds", "articles": ["541"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c541-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fiveYearsSinceAct"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exercisesRevocation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationRightExtinguished"/>
            <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c542-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>债务人影响债权人债权实现的行为被撤销的，自始没有法律约束力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c542-ds", "articles": ["542"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c542-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revoked"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noBindingForceAbInitio"/>
            <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c538-doctrine-time-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>学理（笔记客观要件一）：债权须成立于债务人处分行为之前，债权成立在后的不得撤销
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c538-doctrine-time-ds", "articles": ["538"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c538-doctrine-time-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:debtRelation"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:actOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimArisesBeforeAct"/>
                <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:revocationGround"/>
              <ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c538-doctrine-nonproperty-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>学理（笔记客观要件一）：非以财产为标的的行为（结婚、收养、继承的承认或抛弃等）不可撤销
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c538-doctrine-nonproperty-ds", "articles": ["538"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g4373", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c538-doctrine-nonproperty-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
