          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:performanceExcluded"/>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c580-exc2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>债务的标的不适于强制履行或者履行费用过高的，属于不得请求继续履行的除外情形
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c580-exc2-ds", "articles": ["580"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g3844", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c580-exc2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
