    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c743-1-ground-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>第1款要件：出租人明知租赁物有质量瑕疵而不告知承租人，或承租人行使索赔权利时未及时提供必要协助，且因此致使承租人索赔失败
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c743-1-ground-ds", "articles": ["743"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:743", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c743-1-ground-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:financialLease"/>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lessorOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lesseeOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:leasedPropertyOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:And>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:knowsQualityDefect"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                  <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsToInformOfDefect"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                  <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                  <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
              </ruleml:And>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:failsToAssistTimely"/>
                <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimAgainstSellerFails"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lessorCausesClaimFailure"/>
            <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>K</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c743-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>第1款效果：承租人有权请求出租人承担相应的责任（非全额赔偿，按原因力与过错确定）
