    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c311-recover-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>无处分权人将不动产或者动产转让给受让人的，所有权人有权追回（受善意取得规则排除）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c311-recover-ds", "articles": ["311"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2593", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c311-recover-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersWithoutAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c311-recover-ds-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimPropertyReturn"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c311-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>除法律另有规定外，受让人受让时善意、以合理价格受让，应登记的已登记、不需登记的已交付的，取得所有权，原所有权人丧失所有权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c311-1-ds", "articles": ["311"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2593", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c311-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersWithoutAuthority"/>
              <ruleml:Var>D</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:inGoodFaith"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:paidReasonablePrice"/>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferRegistered"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:And>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transferNotRequiringRegistration"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Atom>
                  <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:delivered"/>
                  <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
                </ruleml:Atom>
              </ruleml:And>
            </ruleml:Or>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lawProvidesOtherwiseOnAcquisition"/>
