    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c305-internal-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：按份共有人之间对内转让份额，其他共有人主张优先购买的不予支持，但共有人之间另有约定的除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c305-internal-ds", "articles": ["305"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2785", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c305-internal-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:transfersShare"/>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:shareCoOwner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>R</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:otherShareCoOwner"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Naf>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedOtherwiseAmongCoOwners"/>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Naf>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coOwnerPreemptionRight"/>
              <ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c305-inherit-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记：优先购买权以“转让”为前提，继承、遗赠取得份额的，其他共有人无优先购买权
