            <lrml:Obligation key="c333-2-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>登记机构应当向土地承包经营权人发放土地承包经营权证、林权证等证书，并登记造册，确认土地承包经营权</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>registrationAuthority</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:issueCertificate"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
            <lrml:Obligation key="c333-2-ds-h1">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>登记机构应当向土地承包经营权人发放土地承包经营权证、林权证等证书，并登记造册，确认土地承包经营权</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>registrationAuthority</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recordInRegister"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Obligation>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c339-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>土地承包经营权人可以自主决定依法采取出租、入股或者其他方式向他人流转土地经营权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c339-ds", "articles": ["339"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2928", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c339-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainedLandContractRight"/>
