    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c416-pm-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>动产抵押担保的主债权是抵押物的价款的，构成价款抵押权（购买价款抵押权）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c416-pm-ds", "articles": ["416"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:416", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c416-pm-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:movable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageEstablished"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mortgageeOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:securedClaimIsPriceOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:purchasePriceMortgage"/>
            <ruleml:Var>S</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>M</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c416-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>价款抵押权在标的物交付后十日内办理抵押登记的，优先于抵押物买受人的其他担保物权人受偿，但留置权人除外
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c416-1-ds", "articles": ["416"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:416", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
