    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c377-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>地役权期限由当事人约定
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c377-1-ds", "articles": ["377"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:377", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c377-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementRight"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementTermDeterminedByAgreement"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c377-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>但书：约定的地役权期限不得超过土地承包经营权、建设用地使用权等用益物权的剩余期限
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c377-2-ds", "articles": ["377"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:377", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c377-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementTermDeterminedByAgreement"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usufructOnServientLand"/>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>L</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedEasementTermExceedsRemaining"/>
              <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c377-2-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>但书：约定的地役权期限不得超过土地承包经营权、建设用地使用权等用益物权的剩余期限</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Ind>parties</ruleml:Ind>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreeEasementTermExceedingRemaining"/>
                <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c377-effect-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>学理：超过用益物权剩余期限的部分无效，地役权期限缩短至该用益物权的剩余期限（条文未明定，属解释结论）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c377-effect-ds", "articles": ["377"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:377", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c377-effect-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:agreedEasementTermExceedsRemaining"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:easementTermLimitedToRemainingTerm"/>
            <ruleml:Var>E</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>U</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
