    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c242-1-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>法律规定专属于国家所有的不动产和动产，任何组织或者个人不得取得其所有权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c242-1-ds", "articles": ["242"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:242", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c242-1-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exclusivelyStateOwned"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:immovableOrMovable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Or>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Prohibition key="c242-1-ds-h0">
              <lrml:Paraphrase>法律规定专属于国家所有的不动产和动产，任何组织或者个人不得取得其所有权</lrml:Paraphrase>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acquiresOwnership"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Prohibition>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c242-2-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>“不能取得所有权”的构成性效果：组织或个人对专属于国家所有的财产取得所有权的，该取得不发生效力
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c242-2-ds", "articles": ["242"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "art:242", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c242-2-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exclusivelyStateOwned"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:immovableOrMovable"/>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Or>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:organization"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:naturalPerson"/>
                <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
