    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c240-absolute-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记学理：所有权是法定限度内对物的全面支配，属绝对权，义务主体为所有人以外的一切人，负不作为义务
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c240-absolute-ds", "articles": ["240"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2401", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c240-absolute-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:absoluteOwnership"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="c240-remedy-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记学理：所有权受非法干预或侵害时，所有人享有返还请求权、妨害排除请求权、妨害预防请求权、恢复原状请求权等救济权（消极权能）
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c240-remedy-ds", "articles": ["240"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2401", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c240-remedy-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unlawfullyInterferesWith"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <lrml:SuborderList>
            <lrml:Right key="c240-remedy-ds-h0">
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:Bearer/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:slot>
                <lrml:AuxiliaryParty/>
                <ruleml:Var>O2</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:slot>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:claimReturnRemovalPreventionOrRestoration"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O2</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </lrml:Right>
          </lrml:SuborderList>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c240-exclusive-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记学理：排他性——同一物上只能有一个所有权，非所有人不得对他人财产享有所有权
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c240-exclusive-ds", "articles": ["240"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2401", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c240-exclusive-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:distinctPerson"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
              <ruleml:Var>O2</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c240-perpetual-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>笔记学理：恒久性——所有权不因时效而消灭，也不得预定其存续期间
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c240-perpetual-ds", "articles": ["240"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g2401", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c240-perpetual-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownerOf"/>
            <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
            <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
          </ruleml:Atom>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownershipExtinguishedByLimitation"/>
                <ruleml:Var>O</ruleml:Var>
                <ruleml:Var>T</ruleml:Var>
              </ruleml:Atom>
            </ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Neg>
              <ruleml:Atom>
                <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ownershipHasFixedTerm"/>
