    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1051-cure-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>司法解释：法定无效情形在人民法院受理时已经消失的（如未达婚龄者已达婚龄），不予宣告婚姻无效
CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "rule", "record": {"rule_id": "c1051-cure-ds", "articles": ["1051"], "provenance": {"kind": "draft", "row_id": "card:g6488", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "risk_notes": "⚠ 由 deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb 起草，已通过程序检查（法条、语法、编译、XSD），待专家逐条核对\n⚠ 单版本（DeepSeek），未经双模型核对：重点看是否加入法条没有的内容、但书与例外是否遗漏、适用范围是否被改宽或改窄\n⚠ 重点核对：第 2 次才通过程序检查\n"}, "review_status": "pending_expert_review"}}</lrml:Comment>
      <ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":c1051-cure-ds">
        <ruleml:if>
          <ruleml:And>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageRegistered"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:groundCured"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:And>
        </ruleml:if>
        <ruleml:then>
          <ruleml:Neg>
            <ruleml:Atom>
              <ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:marriageVoid"/>
              <ruleml:Var>A</ruleml:Var>
              <ruleml:Var>B</ruleml:Var>
            </ruleml:Atom>
          </ruleml:Neg>
        </ruleml:then>
      </ruleml:Rule>
    </lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="c1051-applicant-ds">
      <lrml:Comment>司法解释：婚姻当事人及利害关系人（当事人近亲属、基层组织等）可申请宣告婚姻无效
