      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5847", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "中介人未促成合同成立的，不得请求支付报酬；但可以按照约定请求委托人支付从事中介活动支出的必要费用", "rules": ["c964-1-ds", "c964-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001230">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5847", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "中介人故意隐瞒重要事实或者提供虚假情况、损害委托人利益的，不得请求支付报酬", "rules": ["c962-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001231">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5847", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "中介合同即原合同法上的居间合同；与委托合同不同，中介人只报告订立合同的机会或者提供媒介服务，不亲自处理委托事务，报酬原则上以促成合同成立为条件", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001232">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5847", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "与行纪合同不同，中介人不以自己名义与第三人订立合同，也不因此对该合同直接享有权利、承担义务", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001233">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5847", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "LEGO 卡片称“中介人未实际开展中介活动或未支出必要费用的，不得请求必要费用”，法条只要求“按照约定”且限于“必要费用”，未设该要件，故不另立规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001234">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:938", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第1款“一般包括”为示范性、提示性列举，当事人可另行约定其他条款，缺少其中某项不影响合同成立与效力", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001235">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:938", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第3款的书面形式要求属于形式要求，未采用书面形式但一方已履行主要义务、对方接受的，合同仍可成立（第490条第2款），本条不改变该规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001236">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:938", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第2款只要求承诺“有利于业主”且系物业服务人“公开作出”，业主一方作出的公开表示或不利于业主的承诺不适用本款", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001237">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:947", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "合同对通知期限另有约定的，优先于第947条第2款规定的九十日通知期限", "rules": ["c947-2b-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001238">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:947", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "合同对通知期限另有约定的，从其约定，不适用九十日的通知期限", "rules": ["c947-2b-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001239">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:947", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第1款的义务主体是业主（共同决定续聘后应当续订），第2款的义务主体是物业服务人（不同意续聘时应当书面通知），两者义务主体与内容不同", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001240">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:947", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第2款的通知对象为业主或者业主委员会，二者择一即可；通知须采书面形式", "rules": ["c947-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001241">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:939", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "本条是合同相对性的例外：合同虽由建设单位或业主委员会订立，仍对未参与订立的业主发生约束力，优先于“合同仅对当事人具有法律约束力”的一般规则", "rules": ["c939-pre-ds", "c939-comm-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001242">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:939", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "两类合同订立主体不同：前期物业服务合同由建设单位与物业服务人订立，业主未参与；物业服务合同由业主委员会与业主大会依法选聘的物业服务人订立", "rules": ["c939-pre-ds", "c939-comm-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001243">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:939", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只解决合同对业主的约束力；物业服务人的服务义务、业主支付物业费的义务以及业主不得以未接受服务为由拒付，规定在第939条第2款、第944条，本行未挂载", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001244">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:844", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条为原则性、宣示性规定，未设定具体的权利义务或法律后果，故不形式化为可废止规则；违反该导向本身不直接导致技术合同无效，合同效力仍依第850条等具体规定判断", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001245">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:846", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条为任意性规范，支付方式、提成办法均由当事人约定；约定不明时的补充确定规则在第510条、第511条，不在本条范围内", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001246">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:846", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记未引用原文或条号，本条规则全部依据法条原文；LEGO 卡片本行无，未作参考", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001247">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:856", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条是合作开发合同（技术开发合同）中违约责任的特别规定，相对于第577条违约责任的一般规定属于特别规定；因本行未挂载第577条，故不设 override", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001248">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:856", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条以“违反约定并造成研究开发工作停滞、延误或者失败”为要件，与仅需违约的一般违约责任不同，须具备违约与研究工作受阻之间的因果联系", "rules": ["c856-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001249">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "法律另有规定、当事人另有约定优先于“申请专利的权利属于研究开发人”的默认归属规则", "rules": ["c859-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001250">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "委托人的优先受让权限制研究开发人将专利申请权转让给第三人的自由，须先以同等条件向委托人让与", "rules": ["c859-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001251">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "法律另有规定或者当事人另有约定的，从其规定或约定，不适用“申请专利的权利属于研究开发人”的默认规则", "rules": ["c859-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001252">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "LEGO 卡片讲的是“委托事务成果归属”（受托人应将处理委托事务取得的财产转交委托人），属委托合同的一般规则；本条是技术开发合同的特别规定，只解决申请专利的权利、委托人实施权与优先受让权，不产生概括的财产转交义务", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001253">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条限于委托开发；合作开发完成的发明创造（第860条）、委托开发或合作开发完成的技术秘密成果（第861条）适用各自规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001254">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g5618", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记强调“除法律另有规定或者当事人另有约定外，按照其规定或约定”，即法定或约定优先，无规定或约定时才落入默认归属", "rules": ["c859-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001255">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:864", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "禁止限制技术竞争和技术发展的但书，优先于允许约定实施专利、使用技术秘密范围的规则", "rules": ["c864-1-proh-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001256">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:864", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "但书：约定不得限制技术竞争和技术发展，即使属于实施专利、使用技术秘密范围的约定，也不得含此内容", "rules": ["c864-1-proh-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
