    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001584">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:746", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只解决租金数额的构成（购买成本＋出租人合理利润），不涉及租金的支付时间、支付方式与迟延责任；笔记未引用原文或条号，无可据以区分的材料", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001585">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:741", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "当事人约定由承租人索赔的，优先于未作约定时索赔权仍归出租人的默认安排（本条为任意性规定）", "rules": ["c741-1-ds", "c741-default-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001586">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:741", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条为任意性规定：未约定由承租人行使索赔权的，索赔权仍由出租人（买卖合同的买受人）向出卖人行使（学理，条文未明定）", "rules": ["c741-default-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001587">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:741", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "出租人的“协助”义务以承租人实际行使索赔权为前提，并非独立的给付义务；本条不涉及承租人直接向出租人主张租赁物瑕疵责任的问题", "rules": ["c741-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001588">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:744", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "经承租人同意的，出租人可以变更与承租人有关的合同内容（条文以“未经承租人同意”为要件，反面解释；条文未明定，属学理）", "rules": ["c744-consent-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001589">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:744", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只限制“与承租人有关的合同内容”的变更；与承租人无关的合同内容，以及承租人与出卖人之间的其他法律关系，不受本条约束", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001590">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:744", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记与 LEGO 卡片均未涉及本条；本条属融资租赁合同章，与第543条“当事人协商一致可以变更合同”的一般规则不同，其限制的是出租人对买卖合同的变更权，关键在于承租人是否同意", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001591">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:747", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "但书（承租人依赖出租人技能确定租赁物、出租人干预选择租赁物）优先于出租人免责的一般规则", "rules": ["c747-exc-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001592">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:747", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "承租人依赖出租人的技能确定租赁物，或者出租人干预选择租赁物的，出租人不能免责", "rules": ["c747-exc-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001593">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:747", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条免除的是租赁合同中出租人对租赁物的瑕疵担保责任，前提是租赁物由承租人自行选择；若出租人以其技能影响或干预了选择，则回归一般违约责任（学理说明，条文未展开）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001594">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:743", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "第1款（妨碍承租人索赔）与第2款（怠于行使专属索赔权）各自独立适用，同一事实同时满足两款时，承租人可择一或并行主张，互不排除", "rules": ["c743-1-ds", "c743-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001595">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:743", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "出租人已告知质量瑕疵，或已及时提供必要协助的，不构成第1款所列情形；索赔失败与出租人行为无因果关系的，亦不适用第1款（属对要件本身的否定，不另设规则）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001596">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:743", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第747条为一般规则：租赁物不符合约定或不符合使用目的的，出租人不承担责任（承租人依赖出租人技能确定租赁物或出租人干预选择的除外）；本条第1款是该一般规则之外，出租人因妨碍承租人索赔而负责的特别情形", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001597">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:743", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第741条规定承租人行使索赔权利时出租人应当协助；本条第1款第2项即该协助义务（附随义务）的违反后果，第1项则是违反诚信告知义务的后果", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001598">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:743", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第2款针对的是“只能由出租人对出卖人行使”的索赔权（未约定由承租人索赔或约定仅由出租人行使），与第1款针对承租人自己索赔受阻的情形不同", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001599">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:749", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "本条是租赁物致害的特别规定，优先于侵权责任编一般过错责任规则（第1165条）适用", "rules": ["c749-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001600">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:749", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只免除出租人（非占有人）的责任；承租人作为租赁物的占有人、控制人，其对第三人的责任应依侵权责任编另行判断（学理，条文未写）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001601">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:749", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "与第1209条机动车租赁、借用致害规则不同：机动车致害由使用人承担赔偿责任，所有人、管理人仅在有过错时承担相应责任；本条对一般租赁物则直接规定出租人不承担责任", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001602">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:750", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条位于融资租赁合同章，承租人是融资租赁承租人；与普通租赁中出租人负担维修义务（第712条）、承租人仅负妥善保管义务（第714条）不同，本条把占有期间的维修义务分配给承租人", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001603">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:750", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只规定义务本身，未规定违反义务的赔偿责任或租金效果；相关后果分别由其他条文（如第751条）处理，本行不作形式化", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001604">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:748", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "出租人有正当理由的，收回租赁物或者妨碍、干扰占有使用不属于第2款第1项、第2项情形", "rules": ["c748-g1-ds", "c748-g2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001605">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:748", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记未引用原文或条号；本条只规定出租人对承租人占有、使用的保障义务及违反时的赔偿损失请求权，未涉及租金、维修、解除等事项", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001606">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:753", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "承租人经出租人同意而处分的，不属于本款情形，出租人不得据此解除", "rules": ["c753-dispose-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001607">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:753", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条位于融资租赁合同一章，仅适用于融资租赁；一般租赁中承租人未经同意转租等的解除权另依第716条等规定，不在本条范围", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001608">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:753", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本款只赋予出租人解除权，未规定处分行为本身的效力；租赁物所有权属于出租人，承租人擅自处分的效力另依无权处分等规则判断", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001609">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:752", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "法条以“也可以”并列两种救济，学理上认为出租人应择一行使，不宜既请求支付全部租金又解除合同；法条本身未规定同时行使的后果，故不设优先规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001610">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:752", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "“经催告后在合理期限内仍不支付租金”是行使本条救济的前提；催告前出租人只能依约请求到期租金，不能径行请求全部租金或解除合同", "rules": ["c752-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001611">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:754", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记未引用原文或条号，未提供可区分的体系说明；本条是融资租赁合同的特别法定解除事由，与第563条一般法定解除并列，不以一般法定解除事由为条件", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001612">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:755", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "第2款（损失已获赔偿）优先于第1款的赔偿请求权，承租人相应赔偿责任被排除", "rules": ["c755-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001613">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:755", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "因出租人原因致使买卖合同解除、被确认无效或者被撤销的，出租人无权请求承租人赔偿（但书）", "rules": ["c755-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001614">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:755", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只解决买卖合同瑕疵导致融资租赁合同解除时的损失分配，且以出卖人、租赁物由承租人选择为前提；出卖人、租赁物非由承租人选择的，不能依本条向承租人求偿（依文义，笔记未涉及）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001615">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:757", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "当事人的约定优先于本条法定默认归属规则", "rules": ["c757-agreed-ds", "c757-default-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
