    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001618">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:757", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第510条只是补充确定方法，本行未挂载其原文，故仅以谓词 determinablePerArt510 表示“依第510条仍可确定”，不另设规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001619">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:759", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条以“当事人约定承租人仅需支付象征性价款”为前提，属租赁物归承租人的特别情形；无此约定或约定不明时，租赁期限届满租赁物归出租人（第758条第1款，本行未挂载该条）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001620">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:759", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记仅复述条文，未增设要件；条文用“视为”，故所有权归属为法律拟制，无须当事人另行就所有权归属达成合意", "rules": ["c759-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001621">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:760", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "第760条第1款但书（租赁物归承租人并补偿）优先于无约定时“租赁物应当返还出租人”的规则", "rules": ["c760-3-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001622">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:760", "field": "exceptions", "annotation": {"text": "因承租人原因致合同无效，出租人不请求返还或者返还后会显著降低租赁物效用的，不适用“返还出租人”的规则，租赁物所有权归承租人", "rules": ["c760-3-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001623">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:760", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记把本条拆为“无效时按约定归属／无约定则返还出租人”与“但书：归承租人并合理补偿”两个节点，与法条原文一致；本行无 LEGO 卡片", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001624">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:760", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只解决合同无效时租赁物的归属与补偿，合同无效的其他后果（返还价款、折价补偿、赔偿损失等）不在本条，另依第157条处理", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001625">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:767", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "与第766条有追索权保理相区别：有追索权保理中保理人可以向应收账款债权人主张返还保理融资款本息或回购应收账款债权，也可以向应收账款债务人主张，且从债务人处取得的款项扣除本息和费用后有剩余的，剩余部分应当返还给应收账款债权人；无追索权保理则只能向债务人主张，超额部分归保理人", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001626">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:767", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条只规定无追索权保理中保理人的主张对象与超额部分的归属，未规定保理登记、通知债务人等事项，这些事项适用保理合同的一般规则", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001627">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:769", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "保理合同章的特别规定优先于债权转让的一般规定，仅在章内无规定时才转介适用债权转让规则", "rules": ["c769-chapter-ds", "c769-1-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
