    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001872">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g2418", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "LEGO 卡片称无居民海岛所有权不以登记为生效要件、不适用一般物权变动规则、具有绝对优先性，属学理推论，法条未作规定", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001873">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g2418", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第260条是集体所有权客体的列举，与第248条的国家所有权分属不同所有制类型；私人所有权客体为扣除专属国家所有和集体所有之外的财产（笔记）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001874">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:254", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第1款对国防资产直接规定属于国家所有，不以“依照法律规定”为条件；第2款对基础设施则须“依照法律规定为国家所有”才属于国家所有，故第2款多一项构成要件", "rules": ["c254-1-ds", "c254-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001875">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:254", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条用语为“属于国家所有”，与第242条“法律规定专属于国家所有”不同：后者排除其他主体取得所有权，本条不产生该排除效果", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001876">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:254", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记未引用原文或条号，本条仅依原文形式化，未补充学理内容", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001877">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:256", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条赋予的是对国家所有财产的直接支配权能，而非所有权本身；与第255条国家机关的权能相比，事业单位多出“收益”一项，但收益、处分均须依照法律和国务院的有关规定，不得自主处分", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001878">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:258", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条为宣示性与禁止性规定，未规定侵占、哄抢、私分、截留、破坏国家财产后的责任形式；造成损害的，应依侵权责任编等规定另行处理", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001879">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:258", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条保护对象限于国家所有的财产，集体所有、私人所有的财产分别由第259条、第260条以下及物权编其他规定保护", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001880">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:257", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条是宣示性、授权性规定，只解决国家出资企业中“国家所有权由谁代表行使”的问题，不直接为当事人创设民事请求权；出资人职责与权益的具体内容、行使方式依公司法、企业国有资产法等特别规定", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001881">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:257", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "“分别代表”指按企业出资关系分别由国务院（中央层面）与地方人民政府（地方层面）代表，具体划分标准法条未定，属学理与国有资产管理体制的内容", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001882">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:255", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "处分权能只能在法律和国务院有关规定范围内行使，该限制优先于一般权能的表述", "rules": ["c255-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001883">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:255", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条列举的权能只有占有、使用、处分，不含收益；与所有权四项权能（占有、使用、收益、处分）不同，此点属学理说明", "rules": ["c255-noProfit-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001884">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:255", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条规范的是国家机关作为国家所有权行使主体对其“直接支配”之物的权能，而非国家机关作为机关法人的一般民事权利能力", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001885">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:262", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条解决的是“由谁代表集体行使所有权”，与第261条解决“农民集体所有的不动产和动产属于本集体成员集体所有”的归属问题不同，二者不可混用", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001886">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:262", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条未规定村集体经济组织未设立时的处理；依第101条，未设立村集体经济组织的，村民委员会可以依法代行村集体经济组织的职能", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001887">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:262", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记未涉及本条，本卡片仅依第262条第1款原文形式化，未引入学理补充", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001888">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:259", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条位于物权编国家所有权部分，是管理与责任引致条款：只宣示管理、监督义务并指向“依法承担法律责任”，并未直接规定具体的责任构成与赔偿范围；民事责任仍须结合侵权等规则确定，且“法律责任”不限于民事责任，还包括行政责任、刑事责任", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001889">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:259", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第2款是对企业改制、合并分立、关联交易等特定过程中造成国有财产损失情形的具体列举，与第1款的滥用职权、玩忽职守情形并列，可同时适用，不互相排斥", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001890">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:261", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条解决集体所有权的归属与须经成员决定的事项；由谁代表集体行使所有权（村集体经济组织、村民委员会等）由第262条规定，本行未挂载该条", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001891">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:261", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记与LEGO卡片均未涉及本条，规则全部依条文原文写就；第2款第（五）项为兜底条款，其他法律规定的其他事项同样须经成员决定", "rules": ["c261-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001892">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:265", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "第2款是集体成员撤销权的特别规定，优先于法人、非法人组织决议撤销的一般规定（第85条、第94条）", "rules": ["c265-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001893">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:265", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第1款是对世的禁止性规范，义务主体为任何组织或者个人；第2款是集体成员的个别救济权，义务主体为作出决定的农村集体经济组织、村民委员会或其负责人", "rules": ["c265-1-ds", "c265-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-001894">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:265", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "第2款撤销的对象限于农村集体经济组织、村民委员会或者其负责人作出的决定，不及于集体成员依第261条就集体事项作出的决定", "rules": ["c265-2-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
