      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:1044", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条属于原则性、宣示性条款，不产生构成性结论或可废止的道义结论，故不写规则，rules 为空列表；违反第2款禁止性规定的行为，其效力与责任依收养编其他条文及总则关于无效民事法律行为的规定处理", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002234">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:1044", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本行笔记未引用原文或条号，亦无 LEGO 卡片可供参考，故本卡片仅以法条原文为准", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002235">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:1042", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "本条是禁止性规范，本身不规定法律后果；重婚的婚姻无效依第1051条，家庭暴力、虐待、遗弃是判决离婚的法定事由（第1079条）和离婚损害赔偿事由（第1091条）", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002236">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:1042", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "学理上，按当地习俗给付彩礼不属于“借婚姻索取财物”；但以结婚为条件强行索要财物、数额明显超出习俗的，落入本条第1款后段禁止范围", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002237">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "art:1042", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "学理上，持续性、经常性的家庭暴力构成虐待，故同一行为可同时落入第3款前段与后段；遗弃以行为人负有扶养、赡养、扶养义务为前提", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002238">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g6441", "field": "priority", "annotation": {"text": "配偶身份排除姻亲认定，“配偶不属姻亲”优先于姻亲的认定规则", "rules": ["c1045-affinity-excl-ds"]}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
