      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g8071", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "LEGO卡片中“署名权不同于姓名权”的区分针对著作权，本条不涉及；肖像权是与姓名权、名称权并列的具体人格权，其客体是可被识别的外部形象而非姓名或名称", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
    </lrml:FactualStatement>
    <lrml:FactualStatement key="review-draft_annotations-002376">
      <lrml:Comment>CNLR_REVIEW_META:{"kind": "draft_annotations", "record": {"row_id": "card:g8071", "field": "distinguish", "annotation": {"text": "笔记中“推定许可他人行使发表权”“著作人身权不得转让”等规则均无本条依据；本条只规定肖像权的享有与权能，未规定许可使用的推定、期限与限制", "rules": []}, "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash-mb", "review_status": "pending_expert_review", "retrieval_use": "annotation_only; no edge inferred from free text"}}</lrml:Comment>
